ing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/8003e7b69bbc4d27e47fbbcf9bfa3ef962a2c1bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:22:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:22:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test(e2e): a 503 from a composed remote''s BFF comes back typed (ADR-106)\n\nThe last #345 acceptance item. In the composed meridian page, the spec calls\nabc-kids flappy''s own mfe.query() through its federation container, with\nPlaywright answering the BFF URL with a 503, and asserts the envelope is\n{ data: null, errors: [{ type: ''network'', retryable: true, status: 503 }] }.\n\nFaking at the network layer keeps the assertion on classification rather\nthan on any BFF being down. Red against a pre-ADR-106 runtime (message\nonly), green against main''s runtime.\n\nCloses #345\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VaBtNmWafs9ZcQQWMbdmy2","tree":{"sha":"7c175dd5535b92370c21f62e9392fd4a8ead75a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/7c175dd5535b92370c21f62e9392fd4a8ead75a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/8003e7b69bbc4d27e47fbbcf9bfa3ef962a2c1bf","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c175dd5535b92370c21f62e9392fd4a8ead75a2\nparent 742b0025e1af013da67d404615e312d005e12e03\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790547731 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790547731 +0000\n\ntest(e2e): a 503 from a composed remote''s BFF comes back typed (ADR-106)\n\nThe last #345 acceptance item. In the composed meridian page, the spec calls\nabc-kids flappy''s own mfe.query() through its federation container, with\nPlaywright answering the BFF URL with a 503, and asserts the envelope is\n{ data: null, errors: [{ type: ''network'', retryable: true, status: 503 }] }.\n\nFaking at the network layer keeps the assertion on classification rather\nthan on any BFF being down. Red against a pre-ADR-106 runtime (message\nonly), green against main''s runtime.\n\nCloses #345\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VaBtNmWafs9ZcQQWMbdmy2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL1ir1hs\nm2NVfYHhZG0F45EBPXi1GZQjvQmZPa1NlSXDvegq6DAT5YtesQy/iLhPfT+reayNQfbPaGnVy9X+\nDQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T22:22:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_a