n four docs still citing\npackages/runtime/src/base-control-plane.ts after its removal. They now\ncite packages/control-plane/ or layout-manager.ts; the slides'' bare\nfilename is fixed too. ADR-078 and PDR-008 keep their historical\nmentions (records are not edited).\n\nRefs #385\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNfUuV4e\n+PwCQWUx8UBpkehzAqiG4rbxj1vrvYF8XeOLqM4QzCdZOydEJ9A8bTk+/1DPbaH8jLQw/1SpdMeq\neQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T18:11:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/6439f0183b1f6c427b5e77317a3479c13c14c350","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKDY0MzlmMDE4M2IxZjZjNDI3YjVlNzczMTdhMzQ3OWMxM2MxNGMzNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/71343ac9088fca70de043cd7159ae4