lic"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/bc6895559b9687418e2d66e6219449c6472fb5f0","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKGJjNjg5NTU1OWI5Njg3NDE4ZTJkNjZlNjIxOTQ0OWM2NDcyZmI1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58","sha":"7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58"}],"sha":"bc6895559b9687418e2d66e6219449c6472fb5f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/bc6895559b9687418e2d66e6219449c6472fb5f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:30:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:30:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(runtime): remove test-only accessors, ContextValidator and GraphQLWebSocketClient\n\n- getCacheState / getValidationState / getErrorHandlingState and their\n  *State interfaces read context fields no handler writes (slimmed out\n  of Context in #253), so they could only return undefined. Only their\n  own tests called them.\n- ContextValidator: two static helpers nothing called. ContextFactory,\n  in the same file, is live and stays.\n- GraphQLWebSocketClient: the pre-ADR-057 per-MFE socket client.\n  ADR-057 replaced it with the host-owned transport virtualised into a\n  DaemonChannel per slot; nothing constructs it. The\n  DaemonWebSocketClient interface it implemented is live and stays.\n  The control-plane.md example that built one now builds the real\n  GraphQLTransportWsDaemonTransport.\n\nThese leave the public runtime barrel, so per ADR-082 the change\ncarries a PLATFORM_MIGRATIONS entry (runtime-dead-exports-removed) that\nnames any developer-owned use and what replaces it. No template or\nexample imports any of them (check:mfe-drift / check:mfe-consistency\nclean over 21 MFEs).\n\nCloses #386\nCloses #387\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j","tree":{"sha":"c15c1178cb5498a5be548c39c29f9051304b24f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/c15c1178cb5498a5be548c39c29f9051304b24f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58","verification":{"payload":"tree c15c1178cb5498a5be548c39c29f9051304b24f5\nparent 6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346601 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346601 +0000\n\nchore(runtime): remove test-only accessors, ContextValidator and GraphQLWebSocketClient\n\n- getCacheState / getValidationState / getErrorHandlingState and their\n  *State interfaces read context fields no handler writes (slimmed out\n  of Context in #253), so they could only return undefined. Only their\n  own tests called them.\n- ContextValidator: two static helpers nothing called. ContextFactory,\n  in the same file, is live and stays.\n- GraphQLWebSocketClient: the pre-ADR-057 per-MFE socket client.\n  ADR-057 replaced it with the host-owned transport virtualised into a\n  DaemonChannel per slot; nothing constructs it. The\n  DaemonWebSocketClient interface it implemented is live and stays.\n  The control-plane.md example that built one now builds the real\n  GraphQLTransportWsDaemonTransport.\n\nThese leave the public runtime barrel, so per ADR-082 the change\ncarries a PLATFORM_MIGRATIONS entry (runtime-dead-exports-removed) that\nnames any developer-owned use and what replaces it. No template or\nexample imports any of them (check:mfe-drift / check:mfe-consistency\nclean over 21 MFEs).\n\nCloses #386\nCloses #387\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIqRk89K\nfRowhJ4hA3wa+30hFOhukxb7rEUY8Ybj0QQOCTtV2wMM2p8zOn3MO66yLzXc0swTClFULbI3/jiQ\nmwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T14:31:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKDdlODBmZTcxMTQwYzNiMTJmMWRkOGZjNzhkZTA1YjFiZWIwZmRlNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12","sha":"6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12"}],"sha":"7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/7e80fe71140c3b12f1dd8fc78de05b1beb0fde58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:25:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:25:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(dsl): remove dead manifest helper cluster\n\nparseManifestFromDirectory, getCapabilityNames, getDomainCapabilities,\nhasDataLayer and addCapability arrived with the ADR-061 package promotion\nand never gained a caller: their only references were the barrel and\ntheir own tests. The live parser API (findManifest,\nparseAndValidateDirectory, writeManifest, createMinimalManifest, ...) is\nuntouched.\n\nCloses #392\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j","tree":{"sha":"686821806c8d6197e8d5772f2591cd8d8222acd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/686821806c8d6197e8d5772f2591cd8d8222acd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12","verification":{"payload":"tree 686821806c8d6197e8d5772f2591cd8d8222acd1\nparent a6a0a5fb15032f10f3c8c3760439df33941029f0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346338 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346338 +0000\n\nchore(dsl): remove dead manifest helper cluster\n\nparseManifestFromDirectory, getCapabilityNames, getDomainCapabilities,\nhasDataLayer and addCapability arrived with the ADR-061 package promotion\nand never gained a caller: their only references were the barrel and\ntheir own tests. The live parser API (findManifest,\nparseAndValidateDirectory, writeManifest, createMinimalManifest, ...) is\nuntouched.\n\nCloses #392\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNA4UgTr\nzocnefkUguhsBX+tLtAHtzTuUfX2Sj2EhkUyagVw7+R8bApOHVZLhsU6FS30sRjKME9OOyV+5DfR\nyAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T14:31:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKDZmNzM1YmE2Y2JmNzBhOWE4ODRiOWY1ZTc0NWE5MzA5ZmVkYmFjMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/a6a0a5fb15032f10f3c8c3760439df33941029f0","sha":"a6a0a5fb15032f10f3c8c3760439df33941029f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/a6a0a5fb15032f10f3c8c3760439df33941029f0"}],"sha":"6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/6f735ba6cbf70a9a884b9f5e745a9309fedbac12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/a6a0a5fb15032f10f3c8c3760439df33941029f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:25:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:25:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore: remove unreferenced singleton exports\n\n- resolveBundlerName: one-line accessor nothing called; its test now\n  asserts the same derivation through resolveWebTarget(...).bundler.\n- validateManifestDirectory (plugin-coder oracle): wrapper over\n  parseAndValidateDirectory, which the oracle already re-exports.\n- hasSwiftTarget / hasRustTarget: never called; the live target API is\n  with*Target / enable*TargetInFile.\n\nDeliberately kept: unregisterVariant / unregisterFileContributor are the\ntest-isolation half of module-level registries that framework-rust,\nframework-swift and the CLI reach across the @seans-mfe/codegen barrel,\nso they cannot become a local test helper. ownershipOf is ADR-093 §4''s\nnamed decision and is held for a maintainer call.\n\nRefs #393\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j","tree":{"sha":"2c400c12d8c23f3a4a747c11e0748194266c9a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/2c400c12d8c23f3a4a747c11e0748194266c9a0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/a6a0a5fb15032f10f3c8c3760439df33941029f0","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c400c12d8c23f3a4a747c11e0748194266c9a0e\nparent 51aea7ebdfe66ca065a8f73e0c964a234b147209\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346305 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346305 +0000\n\nchore: remove unreferenced singleton exports\n\n- resolveBundlerName: one-line accessor nothing called; its test now\n  asserts the same derivation through resolveWebTarget(...).bundler.\n- validateManifestDirectory (plugin-coder oracle): wrapper over\n  parseAndValidateDirectory, which the oracle already re-exports.\n- hasSwiftTarget / hasRustTarget: never called; the live target API is\n  with*Target / enable*TargetInFile.\n\nDeliberately kept: unregisterVariant / unregisterFileContributor are the\ntest-isolation half of module-level registries that framework-rust,\nframework-swift and the CLI reach across the @seans-mfe/codegen barrel,\nso they cannot become a local test helper. ownershipOf is ADR-093 §4''s\nnamed decision and is held for a maintainer call.\n\nRefs #393\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI41yi2q\nwrb0ipoDdJTe5IWJvGmqXmG3D8/TWeiEN2D95pop7XgZFLu9X1w/RjUGKVHFIJJJ/4KJFpbtTNm9\nMA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T14:31:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id