","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/51aea7ebdfe66ca065a8f73e0c964a234b147209/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:24:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:24:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(codegen): remove dead KNOWN_MESH_* allow-lists\n\nMesh classification was single-sourced into classifyMeshEntry in\n@seans-mfe/contracts by ADR-092. The two Sets survived \"so bff:init,\nwhich imports them\" kept working, but bff:init imports only\nDEPENDENCY_VERSIONS and the DEFAULT_MESH_* tables. Nothing read them.\n\nAlso drops their sole-purpose contracts import and the now-empty\n\"Validation Layer\" section header.\n\nCloses #390\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j","tree":{"sha":"3cca195bcfa2ba4ec4153f9e17ff6bccf88eeb25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/3cca195bcfa2ba4ec4153f9e17ff6bccf88eeb25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/51aea7ebdfe66ca065a8f73e0c964a234b147209","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cca195bcfa2ba4ec4153f9e17ff6bccf88eeb25\nparent 6b397c6715fa4788e1cf6bae4aca7e7e50b21675\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346265 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346265 +0000\n\nchore(codegen): remove dead KNOWN_MESH_* allow-lists\n\nMesh classification was single-sourced into classifyMeshEntry in\n@seans-mfe/contracts by ADR-092. The two Sets survived \"so bff:init,\nwhich imports them\" kept working, but bff:init imports only\nDEPENDENCY_VERSIONS and the DEFAULT_MESH_* tables. Nothing read them.\n\nAlso drops their sole-purpose contracts import and the now-empty\n\"Validation Layer\" section header.\n\nCloses #390\n\nCo-Authored-By: Cla