-mfe-tool/git/trees/c11ce24830badfc0e2b99ee48e4dce3109647180"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/6b397c6715fa4788e1cf6bae4aca7e7e50b21675","verification":{"payload":"tree c11ce24830badfc0e2b99ee48e4dce3109647180\nparent f912d3e365e5124753591c1904e6296c59aeb297\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346252 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790346252 +0000\n\nchore: remove expired backward-compat shims\n\nDelete the src/oclif/envelope.ts and src/oclif/json-output.ts re-export\nshims (marked \"for one release cycle\" in April; no importers), the\npackages/dsl/src/types.ts re-export layer (every type is already on the\nbarrel via ./schema; its three VALID_* constants had no readers), and the\nunused @deprecated PlanDiagnostic alias.\n\nenvelope''s coverage lives on in packages/contracts/src/__tests__/envelope.test.ts.\n\nCloses #389\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JhvYhXezqjQ6frNzWcpm4j\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCYo1rEu\nytOwP0pBthh1Th+mjhTp+tOPDirMz3iczqBXaS71M+qFnv24ng+li9O+mVj/R7xUBtWWFL2Zsav5\nqwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T14:31:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cla