rs/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/f71207e26746d6bb6aaf689d2645047bba426b19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:54:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:54:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(adr): record ADR-104 as superseding ADR-065 in part\n\nADR-104 replaces one rejected alternative in ADR-065 (TypeDoc HTML, \"rejected\nfor now\") and leaves the rest standing, so it is a partial supersession: the\nsame shape as ADR-060 → ADR-056 and ADR-068 → ADR-058.\n\n- ADR-104: supersedes: [65], and its Boundaries say it is partial.\n- ADR-065: superseded-by: [104], status stays Implemented, and a\n  \"Superseded by ADR-104\" note under that alternative, as ADR-056 carries for\n  ADR-060. The rest of ADR-065 is unchanged.\n- docs/spec.md: ADR index regenerated.\n\ncheck:adr passes; with the back-link removed it fails\nsupersession-bidirectional, so the gate holds the link.\n\nRefs ADR-104.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS","tree":{"sha":"702608641be625d973e37789a52aa49234ad13fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/702608641be625d973e37789a52aa49234ad13fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/f71207e26746d6bb6aaf689d2645047bba426b19","verification":{"payload":"tree 702608641be625d973e37789a52aa49234ad13fe\nparent c2e19532c6076929da06865d44fde8f78471bf22\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790297678 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790297678 +0000\n\ndocs(adr): record ADR-104 as superseding ADR-065 in part\n\nADR-104 replaces one rejected alternative in ADR-065 (TypeDoc HTML, \"rejected\nfor now\") and leaves the rest standing, so it is a partial supersession: the\nsame shape as ADR-060 → ADR-056 and ADR-068 → ADR-058.\n\n- ADR-104: supersedes: [65], and its Boundaries say it is partial.\n- ADR-065: superseded-by: [104], status stays Implemented, and a\n  \"Superseded by ADR-104\" note under that alternative, as ADR-056 carries for\n  ADR-060. The rest of ADR-065 is unchanged.\n- docs/spec.md: ADR index regenerated.\n\ncheck:adr passes; with the back-link removed it fails\nsupersession-bidirectional, so the gate holds the link.\n\nRefs ADR-104.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI82aZ0M\n9RZMVEsKfZBqjVJD9m+UZoMM/nl7gY9g9qXw2h7MQKkIrCi9wgGA9AjZSevFp+9ZOd3fg9IEQ+3K\nDAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T00:54:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/f71207e26746d6bb6aaf689d2645047bba426b19","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKGY3MTIwN2UyNjc0NmQ2YmI2YWFmNjg5ZDI2NDUwNDdiYmE0MjZiMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/c2e19532c6076929da06865d44fde8f78471bf22","sha":"c2e19532c6076929da06865d44fde8f78471bf22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/c2e19532c6076929da06865d44fde8f78471bf22"}],"sha":"f71207e26746d6bb6aaf689d2645047bba426b19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/f71207e26746d6bb6aaf689d2645047bba426b19"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/c2e19532c6076929da06865d44fde8f78471bf22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:52:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:52:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(docs): publish an HTML API reference on the docs site (ADR-104)\n\nThe published site linked the system map, the schematics and the deck but not\nthe API reference, which existed only as Markdown in docs/api. ADR-065 had\nrejected TypeDoc HTML \"for now\" as undiffable and unhosted; the Pages site now\nhosts it, and building it at publish time keeps it out of the repository, so\npull requests still review the Markdown.\n\n- typedoc.html.json extends typedoc.json and swaps the Markdown plugin for the\n  HTML theme, so both outputs describe the same exports. `npm run\n  build:docs:html` builds it into _site/api (gitignored, eslint-ignored).\n- pages.yml: npm ci, build:packages and TypeDoc into _site/api, all\n  non-fatal; republishes when the four packages'' sources or the TypeDoc\n  configs change.\n- assemble-site.js: the deck card''s keep-or-drop logic becomes a list of\n  optional cards; the new API card is kept only when api/index.html exists.\n  Tested in scripts/__tests__/assemble-site.test.ts.\n- Navigation links in the HTML are absolute: TypeDoc repeats them verbatim on\n  pages at every depth, and check-site.js rejected the relative form on 400+\n  pages on the first build.\n\nVerified locally: 429 pages, 11,300 in-site links, 0 check-site problems; the\ncard links through and TypeDoc''s search finds LoadResult.\n\nRefs ADR-104.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS","tree":{"sha":"626b3887ef3288cd97f2b63fdc562bb2621e26e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/626b3887ef3288cd97f2b63fdc562bb2621e26e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/c2e19532c6076929da06865d44fde8f78471bf22","verification":{"payload":"tree 626b3887ef3288cd97f2b63fdc562bb2621e26e9\nparent a505cfb556becc5773d8e07881131856f874d7cc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790297563 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790297563 +0000\n\nfeat(docs): publish an HTML API reference on the docs site (ADR-104)\n\nThe published site linked the system map, the schematics and the deck but not\nthe API reference, which existed only as Markdown in docs/api. ADR-065 had\nrejected TypeDoc HTML \"for now\" as undiffable and unhosted; the Pages site now\nhosts it, and building it at publish time keeps it out of the repository, so\npull requests still review the Markdown.\n\n- typedoc.html.json extends typedoc.json and swaps the Markdown plugin for the\n  HTML theme, so both outputs describe the same exports. `npm run\n  build:docs:html` builds it into _site/api (gitignored, eslint-ignored).\n- pages.yml: npm ci, build:packages and TypeDoc into _site/api, all\n  non-fatal; republishes when the four packages'' sources or the TypeDoc\n  configs change.\n- assemble-site.js: the deck card''s keep-or-drop logic becomes a list of\n  optional cards; the new API card is kept only when api/index.html exists.\n  Tested in scripts/__tests__/assemble-site.test.ts.\n- Navigation links in the HTML are absolute: TypeDoc repeats them verbatim on\n  pages at every depth, and check-site.js rejected the relative form on 400+\n  pages on the first build.\n\nVerified locally: 429 pages, 11,300 in-site links, 0 check-site problems; the\ncard links through and TypeDoc''s search finds LoadResult.\n\nRefs ADR-104.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH7T8vP/\nXZajLEHZEAg6jqdPmysgw+MthPVzjXSR1O4cvQGP7ww64Ch4lxkcix82yQudZJy4u3XSck0pbqTt\n/w0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T00:52:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followin