{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/dd7381a67f739c25fc5566693427f6bfd27df766/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:37:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T00:37:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(site): plain-language pass on the published pages\n\nRewrites sentences on the five published pages that read as machine-written,\nwithout changing any fact, number, heading structure, path or link:\n\n- \"not X — it''s Y\" contrasts, mirrored pairs (\"autonomy in what..., agreement\n  on how...\") and closing flourishes (\"that is the platform''s whole claim,\n  demonstrated\", \"the entire platform\") become plain statements.\n- Intensifiers dropped where they carried nothing: \"deliberately\" (13 uses),\n  \"genuinely\", \"honestly\", \"actually\".\n- Em-dash asides rewritten as sentences, colons or commas: 78 → 7 visible on\n  the system map (the rest are the title, the reel caption and the generated\n  decision-status block, which is not hand-edited).\n- Figure headings on the three architecture pages become descriptive (\"Four\n  actors, one cycle\" → \"Four parts in one loop\"), and a few diagram quips\n  (\"the bright line, machine-checked\", \"teal is machinery\") are made literal.\n- CLI schematics intro: fixes a doubled \"and\".\n\nSVG text was kept within its boxes (checked in Chromium). assemble-site +\ncheck-site, build:system-map:check and docs:check-paths pass.\n\nRefs #380.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS","tree":{"sha":"2e455402d108790ded966632cceb1530f5c7b196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/2e455402d108790ded966632cceb1530f5c7b196"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/dd7381a67f739c25fc5566693427f6bfd27df766","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e455402d108790ded966632cceb1530f5c7b196\nparent f33395b536a9c10685a777bac4ef559202bdd475\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790296628 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790296628 +0000\n\ndocs(site): plain-language pass on the published pages\n\nRewrites sentences on the five published pages that read as machine-written,\nwithout changing any fact, number, heading structure, path or link:\n\n- \"not X — it''s Y\" contrasts, mirrored pairs (\"autonomy in what..., agreement\n  on how...\") and closing flourishes (\"that is the platform''s whole claim,\n  demonstrated\", \"the entire platform\") become plain statements.\n- Intensifiers dropped where they carried nothing: \"deliberately\" (13 uses),\n  \"genuinely\", \"honestly\", \"actually\".\n- Em-dash asides rewritten as sentences, colons or commas: 78 → 7 visible on\n  the system map (the rest are the title, the reel caption and the generated\n  decision-status block, which is not hand-edited).\n- Figure headings on the three architecture pages become descriptive (\"Four\n  actors, one cycle\" → \"Four parts in one loop\"), and a few diagram quips\n  (\"the bright line, machine-checked\", \"teal is machinery\") are made literal.\n- CLI schematics intro: fixes a doubled \"and\".\n\nSVG text was kept within its boxes (checked in Chromium). assemble-site +\ncheck-site, build:system-map:check and docs:check-paths pass.\n\nRefs #380.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCNKw7xY\nzghlaGXFGCGOfFJFWqn8eNV4Rgpe0mpCsRCjPFK6aebVYRKN2dctm