Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs: ADR-099 Rust native target; regenerate indexes, schemas and API docs\n\nADR-099 records what the Rust artifact is and its three subtractions from\nthe Swift lane (no UI, no HTTP client/runtime, no build-time manifest step).\nRegenerated: ADR index, system map, manifest field reference, DSL + command\nschemas, docs/api.\n\nRefs ADR-099.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS","tree":{"sha":"8efaec4ebf1d1515245b738f07ee33bfd38c3637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/8efaec4ebf1d1515245b738f07ee33bfd38c3637"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/d7ffb236940a8163247e1ef4f1aea740bb04861d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8efaec4ebf1d1515245b738f07ee33bfd38c3637\nparent 576454e9cac521868be19ea9bd389d1aa821709b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790217634 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790217634 +0000\n\ndocs: ADR-099 Rust native target; regenerate indexes, schemas and API docs\n\nADR-099 records what the Rust artifact is and its three subtractions from\nthe Swift lane (no UI, no HTTP client/runtime, no build-time manifest step).\nRegenerated: ADR index, system map, manifest field reference, DSL + command\nschemas, docs/api.\n\nRefs ADR-099.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAIrFUmW\ntoZicBqwmtqAvEnovedUjwZId1ZGcc/aVm46LHyMOHC2JcNKobGAr7D1mJNUoTnL1dMq2sYrtMeP\nJwQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T02:40:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4