"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/576454e9cac521868be19ea9bd389d1aa821709b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:40:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:40:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(examples): meridian-crew-services builds a Rust crate; check:rust-build gate\n\nmeridian-crew-services declares targets.rust and commits its generated\ncrate. check:rust-build runs cargo build, test, clippy and fmt --check\n(warnings as errors) against every examples/**/rust crate; the new rust CI\njob runs it with --require and re-tests on Rust 1.75, the MSRV the\ngenerated Cargo.toml declares.\n\nRefs ADR-099.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS","tree":{"sha":"d4f6b928acdd26085dd9f702d61a349ec6efeae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/d4f6b928acdd26085dd9f702d61a349ec6efeae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/576454e9cac521868be19ea9bd389d1aa821709b","verification":{"payload":"tree d4f6b928acdd26085dd9f702d61a349ec6efeae8\nparent 930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790217634 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790217634 +0000\n\nfeat(examples): meridian-crew-services builds a Rust crate; check:rust-build gate\n\nmeridian-crew-services declares targets.rust and commits its generated\ncrate. check:rust-build runs cargo build, test, clippy and fmt --check\n(warnings as errors) against every examples/**/rust crate; the new rust CI\njob runs it with --require and re-tests on Rust 1.75, the MSRV the\ngenerated Cargo.toml declares.\n\nRefs ADR-099.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM2c48Qo\nKLb2TxQhvs4CNXynimKXujlj9acQMe4wbauBt2yxwEkXcpz6Jo4bNRTEMPnYaaF0+4pU3udqEuoz\nsQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T02:40:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/576454e9cac521868be19ea9bd389d1aa821709b","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKDU3NjQ1NGU5Y2FjNTIxODY4YmUxOWVhOWJkMzg5ZDFhYTgyMTcwOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504","sha":"930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504"}],"sha":"576454e9cac521868be19ea9bd389d1aa821709b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/576454e9cac521868be19ea9bd389d1aa821709b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commits/930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:40:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:40:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(framework-rust): targets.rust emits a Cargo crate beside the web remote\n\nA manifest may now declare targets.rust. remote:generate emits a\nruntime-agnostic Cargo library crate under rust/, rendered from the same\nplatform contract as the Swift package: six states, ten capabilities, the\nADR-098 hook engine and pipeline order, and the ADR-053/070 query default.\n\n- @seans-mfe/framework-rust: RustCargoPlugin (rust-cargo, targetId rust)\n  carrying build lifecycle + FileContributor (ADR-097). No generator change.\n- dsl: RustTargetSchema (crateName, edition, capabilities); KNOWN_TARGETS.\n- codegen: rust-capability-query rule in mfe:validate, capability-has-a-target\n  for the Rust subset; snakeCase shared by generator and rule.\n- cli: --rust on remote:init / remote:generate via one shared\n  src/targets/enable.ts (swift.ts now delegates to it); mfe:validate scans\n  rust/ and skips rust/target/; drift gate''s maximal manifest covers rust.\n\nGoverned by ADR-095, ADR-097, ADR-099. No PLATFORM_MIGRATIONS entry: the\ntarget is additive and changes no existing developer-owned file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS","tree":{"sha":"09063e05078c6612e34c1d12c9fe9f1221b4e717","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/trees/09063e05078c6612e34c1d12c9fe9f1221b4e717"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/falese/seans-mfe-tool/git/commits/930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504","verification":{"payload":"tree 09063e05078c6612e34c1d12c9fe9f1221b4e717\nparent 28e6a2252751622584a42095d54e001040e8a268\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790217634 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790217634 +0000\n\nfeat(framework-rust): targets.rust emits a Cargo crate beside the web remote\n\nA manifest may now declare targets.rust. remote:generate emits a\nruntime-agnostic Cargo library crate under rust/, rendered from the same\nplatform contract as the Swift package: six states, ten capabilities, the\nADR-098 hook engine and pipeline order, and the ADR-053/070 query default.\n\n- @seans-mfe/framework-rust: RustCargoPlugin (rust-cargo, targetId rust)\n  carrying build lifecycle + FileContributor (ADR-097). No generator change.\n- dsl: RustTargetSchema (crateName, edition, capabilities); KNOWN_TARGETS.\n- codegen: rust-capability-query rule in mfe:validate, capability-has-a-target\n  for the Rust subset; snakeCase shared by generator and rule.\n- cli: --rust on remote:init / remote:generate via one shared\n  src/targets/enable.ts (swift.ts now delegates to it); mfe:validate scans\n  rust/ and skips rust/target/; drift gate''s maximal manifest covers rust.\n\nGoverned by ADR-095, ADR-097, ADR-099. No PLATFORM_MIGRATIONS entry: the\ntarget is additive and changes no existing developer-owned file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QLsKAxwc9YVsKab1o1cvJS\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFXAacSd\np+m1mxn4qqmJ7yFTJgvmHrD062wxZsKHUCkZEZEpT8BcYvYYvqf1Jbpyyk04WVEfE+MhClTO6aks\nagI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T02:40:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/falese/seans-mfe-tool/commit/930ecee32887ba789e2bc265babc44ee495c9504","node_id":"C_kwDONNw3XdoAKDkzMGVjZWUzMjg4N2JhNzg5ZTJiYzI2NWJhYmM0NGVlNDk1Yzk1MDQ","parents":[{"html_url"