Voytovych"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:33:31Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"message":"fix: keep the hub''s claim on VPC slice copies\n\nThe write-back replaced the whole label and annotation maps of each hub\ncopy on every one-minute resync. That removed the label Karmada writes to\nclaim the copy for its propagation policy, and Karmada wrote it back, so\nevery copy changed twice a minute while its source did not change. Each\nchange woke the gateway controller for every Gateway in the namespace.\n\nKey changes:\n- apply the copy with its own field manager instead of updating it, so the\n  write-back owns only the fields it sets\n- test that the hub''s claim survives a publish that carries nothing new\n- test that a label the source drops still leaves the copy","tree":{"sha":"18cf3446825fbe9632d6986ca057178b782b2851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/18cf3446825fbe9632d6986ca057178b782b2851"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/c14fb050e50250a9a65dc97b04c7f8d3ff169bb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git