/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/535f42a30c4ba12e4c57f84ea4b36d4dcdb6b795/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:00:36Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:00:36Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: Route wildcard hostnames with CNAME\n\nPowerDNS expands ALIAS only when the query name equals the record''s\nowner name, so an ALIAS at a wildcard such as \"*.app\" answers NOERROR\nwith no data for every name the wildcard matches. The controller chose\nALIAS for any hostname under a Domain with Status.Apex set, which\nincludes every wildcard in a registrable domain.\n\nKey changes:\n- Wildcard hostnames always get a CNAME routing record, since a\n  wildcard can never be the zone apex\n- Exact and apex hostnames keep their current record type\n- Existing wildcard ALIAS record sets are rewritten in place to CNAME","tree":{"sha":"e216f7e7746739ebe3cb6ba1178e8490116ca971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/e216f7e7746739ebe3cb6ba1178e8490116ca971"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/535f42a30c4ba12e4c57f84ea4b36d4dcdb6b795","verification":{"payload":"tree e216f7e7746739ebe3cb6ba1178e8490116ca971\nparent a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791385236 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791385236 -0500\n\nfix: Route wildcard hostnames with CNAME\n\nPowerDNS expands ALIAS only when the query name equals the record''s\nowner name, so an ALIAS at a wildcard such as \"*.app\" answers NOERROR\nwith no data for every name the wildcard matches. The controller chose\nALIAS for any hostname under a Domain with Status.Apex set, which\nincludes every wildcard in a registrable domain.\n\nKey changes:\n- Wildcard hostnames always get a CNAME routing record, since a\n  wildcard can never be the zone apex\n- Exact and apex hostnames keep their current record type\n- Existing wildcard ALIAS record sets are rewritten in place to CNAME\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasZelAAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYsnTAPwNbTj5IV+OJUVByZ44FLxX9OOc/aPPtfF8wOvMOfYCzQEApwwo8vEGaOYv\nB2qFn9Z5/3qLjTbuy/SJuWP5RQYELAI=\n=WqwO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T15:01:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/535f42a30c4ba12e4c57f84ea4b36d4dcdb6b795","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDUzNWY0MmEzMGM0YmExMmU0YzU3Zjg0ZWE0YjM2ZDRkY2RiNmI3OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71","sha":"a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71"}],"sha":"535f42a30c4ba12e4c57f84ea4b36d4dcdb6b795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/535f42a30c4ba12e4c57f84ea4b36d4dcdb6b795"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5209578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xmc","id":5209578,"login":"0xmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDk1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/7c1f030adaffedbf0325932655e4a2716da4b571/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:31:59Z","email":"mc@datum.net","name":"Michael Costello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:31:59Z","email":"mc@datum.net","name":"Michael Costello"},"message":"fix: Keep HTTPRoute status valid under Gateway API 1.5\n\nGateway API v1.5.1 requires status.parents on HTTPRoute and conditions on\nevery parent entry. When an edge had not yet reported status for a route,\nthe gateway controller still wrote the route''s status with parents as null,\nand routes whose parent entry NSO wrote without conditions before the\nupgrade could not have their status written at all. The project control\nplane rejected every such write, so those routes logged reconcile errors\nuntil their edge reported.\n\nKey changes:\n- Write upstream HTTPRoute status only when it carries a parent entry or\n  one is being removed\n- Remove this gateway''s own parent entry when it has no conditions and the\n  edge has not reported, writing an empty list if none remain; entries for\n  other gateways and controllers are left alone\n- Add an envtest that runs the HTTPRoute status pass against the installed\n  Gateway API CRDs, including routes with entries written before the\n  upgrade, so the API server''s own validation gates the write","tree":{"sha":"76ca8aa6cbc4ce9ca88569a59cf1e5ee8dec66cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/76ca8aa6cbc4ce9ca88569a59cf1e5ee8dec66cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/7c1f030adaffedbf0325932655e4a2716da4b571","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5209578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xmc","id":5209578,"login":"0xmc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDk1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xmc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/7c1f030adaffedbf0325932655e4a2716da4b571","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDdjMWYwMzBhZGFmZmVkYmYwMzI1OTMyNjU1ZTRhMjcxNmRhNGI1NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71","sha":"a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a8402419ef1db1b8682d5081e19fd08ab63f7e71"}],"sha":"7c1f030adaffedbf0325932655e4a2716da4b571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/7c1f030adaffedbf0325932655e4a2716da4b571"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/8a8d8d62698e70fc33c61b88b7fe6ae361c405e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:26:56Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:26:56Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"fix: Label BackendTrafficPolicies so Karmada carries them to the edge\n\nKarmada''s nso-resources ClusterPropagationPolicy only selects a\nBackendTrafficPolicy carrying meta.datumapis.com/upstream-cluster-name.\nThe policy is owned by the downstream HTTPRoute through a plain\ncontroller reference, which sets no labels, so it never left the\nfederation control plane. No edge applied an HTTPProxy''s load balancer\nalgorithm, passive health check or networkService panic threshold.\n\nThe policy now copies the downstream route''s upstream owner labels on\nevery reconcile, so existing policies pick them up too.\n\nFixes #557","tree":{"sha":"4bcb4b25b7ec154be8861f587ef00119a21509ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/4bcb4b25b7ec154be8861f587ef00119a21509ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/8a8d8d62698e70fc33c61b88b7fe6ae361c405e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","followi