"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/3d7b30218635c69d3713dad5839a43207ffc29c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:42:41Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:42:41Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: never revoke a wildcard cert on grant loss\n\nRemoving a project''s wildcard quota grant deleted its serving\ncertificate. Each revoke and regrant cycle reissued the identical\ncertificate and exhausted Let''s Encrypt''s weekly limit, leaving the\nhostname without HTTPS for days.\n\nKey changes:\n- The entitlement gate now applies only to listeners with no\n  controlled TLSCertificate; an existing certificate is kept,\n  mirrored and renewed regardless of the grant or a Milo read error\n- A hostname with no certificate and no grant still gets nothing and\n  reports WildcardNotEntitled\n- Remove certificate and Secret revocation; the one-minute recheck\n  now runs only for listeners waiting on a grant\n- Replace the revocation tests with keep, renewal-mirroring and\n  no-new-issuance tests","tree":{"sha":"5e6a8abfc1c50357499e52f69009ac35065fcb10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/5e6a8abfc1c50357499e52f69009ac35065fcb10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/3d7b30218635c69d3713dad5839a43207ffc29c2","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e6a8abfc1c50357499e52f69009ac35065fcb10\nparent 8279ee24c29983f6875d244b10674d606a0f93d6\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791312161 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791312161 -0500\n\nfix: never revoke a wildcard cert on grant loss\n\nRemoving a project''s wildcard quota grant deleted its serving\ncertificate. Each revoke and regrant cycle reissued the identical\ncertificate and exhausted Let''s Encrypt''s weekly limit, leaving the\nhostname without HTTPS for days.\n\nKey changes:\n- The entitlement gate now applies only to listeners with no\n  controlled TLSCertificate; an existing certificate is kept,\n  mirrored and renewed regardless of the grant or a Milo read error\n- A hostname with no certificate and no grant still gets nothing and\n  reports WildcardNotEntitled\n- Remove certificate and Secret revocation; the one-minute recheck\n  now runs only for listeners waiting on a grant\n- Replace the revocation tests with keep, renewal-mirroring and\n  no-new-issuance tests\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasVBIQAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYlWZAP9ATZrhQHVtaZpIWPtU73uw8KszL3O05aRclEs/ifKfcgD+Iz7GHjl4dbSb\nu59v6Nddt9NxIhHaK0SW9M0UAMv9aQ8=\n=sln/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T18:42:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/3d7b30218635c69d3713dad5839