m/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/92ef423751576902cefeb0a34c252a1bbef5b35a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:45:15Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:45:15Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: rank wildcard denial above transient wait\n\nA wildcard hostname denied with WildcardNotEntitled also leaves the load\nbalancer''s aggregate status in a transient Pending. The Pending sits at\na wider scope, so it won the ranking and the assistant told the customer\nthe state was normal and would clear on its own, while the real cause\nwas listed only as an other cause.\n\nKey changes:\n- When a wildcard denial is present, transient causes rank behind it\n  and behind every stable cause at their own scope\n- Stable causes keep their existing order, and a lone Pending still\n  reads as transient","tree":{"sha":"c26fc65cfbd8a3f8cb7a2c67fd8af8d19f60646f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/c26fc65cfbd8a3f8cb7a2c67fd8af8d19f60646f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/92ef423751576902cefeb0a34c252a1bbef5b35a","verification":{"payload":"tree c26fc65cfbd8a3f8cb7a2c67fd8af8d19f60646f\nparent c34a5f5b3b20862a900537aa2e8b217333421ed6\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791308715 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791308715 -0500\n\nfix: rank wildcard denial above transient wait\n\nA wildcard hostname denied with WildcardNotEntitled also leaves the load\nbalancer''s aggregate status in a transient Pending. The Pending sits at\na wider scope, so it won the ranking and the assistant told the customer\nthe state was normal and would clear on its own, while the real cause\nwas listed only as an other cause.\n\nKey changes:\n- When a wildcard denial is present, transient causes rank behind it\n  and behind every stable cause at their own scope\n- Stable causes keep their existing order, and a lone Pending still\n  reads as transient\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasUzqwAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYsyNAQDq7UnLVOT3azIo329A4xyKDyPRwFHNklBTF4y1jDlJdAD/XThAvNI+qJX3\n2wi8xRDFXCxt/2Tl97y8uq5jOq1FQAE=\n=93n/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T17:45:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-