ain wildcard denial in ALB assistant\n\nThe certificate skill told the assistant to check DNS first for every\nmissing certificate. For a wildcard hostname the project is not enabled\nfor, that sends the customer down DNS troubleshooting that cannot help.\n\nKey changes:\n- Handle WildcardNotEntitled before the DNS-first triage in the\n  certificate skill: contact Datum or use an exact hostname\n- Say Datum is not already working on it, so the customer must ask\n- Keep the platform actionability; the customer''s only move is to ask\n- Pin the catalog entry, rendered cause and skill ordering in tests","tree":{"sha":"098121c684608322c277599e1a7e5074cb1bcf43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/098121c684608322c277599e1a7e5074cb1bcf43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/545f667555a365df4782055db9a2ec65a4ccf17b","verification":{"payload":"tree 098121c684608322c277599e1a7e5074cb1bcf43\nparent 5a6481155315c8d8ca8c9431121a5d8c95449eb4\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791303119 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791303119 -0500\n\nfeat: explain wildcard denial in ALB assistant\n\nThe certificate skill told the assistant to check DNS first for every\nmissing certificate. For a wildcard hostname the project is not enabled\nfor, that sends the customer down DNS troubleshooting that cannot help.\n\nKey changes:\n- Handle WildcardNotEntitled before the DNS-first triage in the\n  certificate skill: contact Datum or use an exact hostname\n- Say Datum is not already working on it, so the customer must ask\n- Keep the platform actionability; the customer''s only move is to ask\n- Pin the catalog entry, rendered cause and skill ordering in tests\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasUdzwAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYs5cAQDmBThOtUR+OTgfS+QuNQZnTy1byXqt30DfmzAkgIB85wD/cHa/+eRpTJfJ\nrDrL8rg2icluMKeRCrg