ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/0ba521d55ba14abd6461e8f4705b8d7ebe96263c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:01:27Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:01:27Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"fix: Mark the load balancer tools read-only for clients\n\nEach tool said \"Read-only.\" in its description, which tells the model, but\ncarried no annotation, which is what an MCP client reads. A client therefore\nasked the person to approve every list, get and diagnose.\n\nKey changes:\n- Annotate every alb_ tool read-only, non-destructive and idempotent\n- Fail the registration test when a tool ships without the annotation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ae34de1e5aa2e854bbd1bbf506da27ce01592ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/5ae34de1e5aa2e854bbd1bbf506da27ce01592ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/0ba521d55ba14abd6461e8f4705b8d7ebe96263c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"ht