6T01:41:29Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: ship wildcard quota in the base catalog\n\nRegister the wildcard-hostnames metric and its default-0 project limit\non the networking ServiceConfiguration in the shared service-catalog\ncomponent instead of the staging-only one, so it ships in the normal\nbundle.\n\nThe limit denies by default and the entitlement check runs only when the\ncertificate service is enabled, so environments without it are\nunaffected.","tree":{"sha":"cace205e16373bc1ffdae0c39f1234adbf819884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/cace205e16373bc1ffdae0c39f1234adbf819884"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/13a9edc104cda7ed49f63f15b3e3314771d0e159","verification":{"payload":"tree cace205e16373bc1ffdae0c39f1234adbf819884\nparent 740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791250889 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791250889 -0500\n\nfeat: ship wildcard quota in the base catalog\n\nRegister the wildcard-hostnames metric and its default-0 project limit\non the networking ServiceConfiguration in the shared service-catalog\ncomponent instead of the staging-only one, so it ships in the normal\nbundle.\n\nThe limit denies by default and the entitlement check runs only when the\ncertificate service is enabled, so environments without it are\nunaffected.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasRRyQAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYhaPAQDoXaPQHVLFyNGaqQGBcIQE3FW033mRqRhKax6M0sS+mwEAm41WJZzat/j2\nomloFQmLgZrwxZXY/oGf/GlrXhqfWA4=\n=FwmI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T01:41:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/13a9edc104cda7ed49f63f15b3e3314771d0e159","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDEzYTllZGMxMDRjZGE3ZWQ0OWY2M2YxNWIzZTMzMTQ3NzFkMGUxNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc","sha":"740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc"}],"sha":"13a9edc104cda7ed49f63f15b3e3314771d0e159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/13a9edc104cda7ed49f63f15b3e3314771d0e159"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:33:25Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:33:25Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: gate wildcard hostnames behind a project grant\n\nWildcard custom hostnames get a trusted certificate for any subdomain\nthe tenant names, and the zone-claim check that should stop a tenant\nclaiming a victim''s zone is not in place yet. Deny wildcard certificate\nissuance by default and allow it per project on a staff-issued grant.\n\nKey changes:\n- Read the project''s Milo AllowanceBucket for wildcard hostnames and\n  allow only when status.available is above zero. A missing bucket or\n  any read error denies.\n- Exact hostnames never consult the bucket.\n- On denial set the listener issuance-blocked condition with reason\n  WildcardNotEntitled, which HTTPProxy surfaces on CertificateReady, and\n  do not create the TLSCertificate.\n- On revocation delete the TLSCertificate and the mirrored downstream\n  Secret. Re-check every minute so a grant or revocation takes effect\n  without a spec edit.\n- Gated on the certificate service being enabled; no new flag.\n- Register the metric and a default-0 quota limit in the staging\n  service-catalog component.","tree":{"sha":"27a1802f59a084f6ec4e7faa335388d03259b94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/27a1802f59a084f6ec4e7faa335388d03259b94d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 27a1802f59a084f6ec4e7faa335388d03259b94d\nparent a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791250405 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791250405 -0500\n\nfeat: gate wildcard hostnames behind a project grant\n\nWildcard custom hostnames get a trusted certificate for any subdomain\nthe tenant names, and the zone-claim check that should stop a tenant\nclaiming a victim''s zone is not in place yet. Deny wildcard certificate\nissuance by default and allow it per project on a staff-issued grant.\n\nKey changes:\n- Read the project''s Milo AllowanceBucket for wildcard hostnames and\n  allow only when status.available is above zero. A missing bucket or\n  any read error denies.\n- Exact hostnames never consult the bucket.\n- On denial set the listener issuance-blocked condition with reason\n  WildcardNotEntitled, which HTTPProxy surfaces on CertificateReady, and\n  do not create the TLSCertificate.\n- On revocation delete the TLSCertificate and the mirrored downstream\n  Secret. Re-check every minute so a grant or revocation takes effect\n  without a spec edit.\n- Gated on the certificate service being enabled; no new flag.\n- Register the metric and a default-0 quota limit in the staging\n  service-catalog component.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasRP5QAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYnvUAP9NQYdbt2FWWnAKzb/0H3vbgCRdTMdfwRS8WhzA2pjR6wEAj9f/+1Br1/vR\nH+sOjQKi4gy+/f/B73h9lcvadN6+Ggk=\n=rKoW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T01:33:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDc0MGE5NThjMGJiZWMzNGQyMDdhNDllYmUyZWZmYmIyNDhmY2UzZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09","sha":"a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09"}],"sha":"740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/740a958c0bbec34d207a49ebe2effbb248fce3dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/7094bf3d2ded248917e86dccb32f3277c40a530e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:21:26Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:21:26Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"message":"docs: Describe the registry cache per name\n\nThe design described one cached snapshot per registered domain, which is\nwhat let one name''s nameservers reach another.\n\nKey changes:\n- Cache the registration per registered domain, not the whole result\n- Choose nameservers per name, and say when a failure keeps them\n- Redraw the lookup flow and the cache keys\n\nRelated to #488","tree":{"sha":"1bb5a89ff3f9afea3987b54ec670f89114ed969c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/1bb5a89ff3f9afea3987b54ec670f89114ed969c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/7094bf3d2ded248917e86dccb32f3277c40a530e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/7094bf3d2ded248917e86dccb32f3277c40a530e","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDcwOTRiZjNkMmRlZDI0ODkxN2U4NmRjY2IzMmYzMjc3YzQwYTUzMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b","sha":"b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b"}],"sha":"7094bf3d2ded248917e86dccb32f3277c40a530e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/7094bf3d2ded248917e86dccb32f3277c40a530e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:21:26Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:21:26Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"message":"fix: Keep nameservers when their lookup fails\n\nA failed NS query counted as \"no delegation here\", so a timeout or SERVFAIL\nat a subdomain gave it the parent''s nameservers. That answer then stayed in\nthe Domain''s status until the next refresh, a day later.\n\nKey changes:\n- Move the NS query up a label only on a \"not found\" answer\n- Return the registration with a NameserverLookupError on any other failure\n- Keep the Domain''s last known nameservers on that error and retry after\n  the retry backoff\n\nRelated to #488","tree":{"sha":"869d8581c893ba6bf42827ac16382ea79adfb767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/869d8581c893ba6bf42827ac16382ea79adfb767"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKGI3N2NjNTc0MDY5MmZmZGJlYzAzODZmZDgxMWI3ZGI0Mzc2MDcwOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160","sha":"ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160"}],"sha":"b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/b77cc5740692ffdbec0386fd811b7db43760708b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:04:11Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:04:59Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"message":"fix: Choose nameservers for each name\n\nThe registry lookup cached its whole result under the registered domain,\nbut the nameservers in it were chosen for the name that was looked up. For\n15 minutes every other name under that domain got the same nameservers, so\na delegated subdomain could get its parent''s and the parent a child''s.\n\nKey changes:\n- Cache the registration per registered domain under a new key\n- Choose the nameservers for each name on every lookup\n- Never read a whole result cached under the registered domain by an older\n  release, which shares the cache during a rollout\n- Give each result its own copy of the registration, which callers update\n\nRelated to #488","tree":{"sha":"44c12e1916d864b53cfe4e9195eaad13bb928c74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/44c12e1916d864b53cfe4e9195eaad13bb928c74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKGVjNDE5M2I1NWMzMzBlOTU1Y2Y5OTU5MjE5NjNiODg3YWYyYzMxNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09","sha":"a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a46e840ffebf29f7bdfb4683033587d7fc6e4a09"}],"sha":"ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/ec4193b55c330e955cf995921963b887af2c3160"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starr