a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","sha":"df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8"}],"sha":"ef4df9ee6c726a9aa126eff2490c7763475a1e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/ef4df9ee6c726a9aa126eff2490c7763475a1e65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/2786fbb93aaac59d0612b3447929b55ee1c338fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:57:31Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:56:37Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: show records to publish in alb describe\n\nThe plugin shared the operator''s hostname check, so it refused wildcards\nbefore the platform could judge them, and describe gave no way to see the\nDNS records a hostname still waits on. hostname add now accepts a single\nleading wildcard label, and describe prints the records still to publish\nfrom the load balancer''s status.\n\nKey changes:\n- accept \"*.\" hostnames locally; the platform decides whether they are\n  enabled and proven\n- print each refused hostname''s reason beneath it\n- list missing user records once each, with the certificate CNAME, and\n  platform records still waiting on Datum DNS apart\n- point the \"DNS not delegated\" hint at the certificate record, so the\n  certificate can issue at the provider that serves the domain today\n- document wildcards and the records list","tree":{"sha":"127270efbe7f4765ec8d25c08903eb825905f752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/127270efbe7f4765ec8d25c08903eb825905f752"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/2786fbb93aaac59d0612b3447929b55ee1c338fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 127270efbe7f4765ec8d25c08903eb825905f752\nparent 971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790978251 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222997 -0500\n\nfeat: show records to publish in alb describe\n\nThe plugin shared the operator''s hostname check, so it refused wildcards\nbefore the platform could judge them, and describe gave no way to see the\nDNS records a hostname still waits on. hostname add now accepts a single\nleading wildcard label, and describe prints the records still to publish\nfrom the load balancer''s status.\n\nKey changes:\n- accept \"*.\" hostnames locally; the platform decides whether they are\n  enabled and proven\n- print each refused hostname''s reason beneath it\n- list missing user records once each, with the certificate CNAME, and\n  platform records still waiting on Datum DNS apart\n- point the \"DNS not delegated\" hint at the certificate record, so the\n  certificate can issue at the provider that serves the domain today\n- document wildcards and the records list\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPk1QAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYmsaAQDaq8XyVW7atb1bw8vXSRSetFt4cKtvVz4Jtj5SMdYeFAD+PLN3nowj3xq8\nUM1hIh3hEu1tnRCeyYEDbUQCFOjJHwc=\n=eL66\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/2786fbb93aaac59d0612b3447929b55ee1c338fb","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDI3ODZmYmI5M2FhYWM1OWQwNjEyYjM0NDc5MjliNTVlZTFjMzM4ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1","sha":"971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1"}],"sha":"2786fbb93aaac59d0612b3447929b55ee1c338fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/2786fbb93aaac59d0612b3447929b55ee1c338fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:55:34Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:56:37Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"test: prove wildcard certificates issue end to end\n\nWith wildcard admission in place, drive a DNS-proven wildcard through the\nwhole gateway reconcile: the request, the mirror and the listener. The\ncertificate service path no longer answers HTTP-01 for any hostname, so\nthe earlier guard that kept HTTP challenge answers off wildcards is gone;\na test keeps the property.\n\nKey changes:\n- request exactly one DNS-01 TLSCertificate for the wildcard and no\n  cert-manager Certificate\n- answer no HTTP challenge for a wildcard, whatever the status lists\n- admit the listener once a certificate covering the wildcard is mirrored\n- refuse a broader wildcard certificate that does not name the listener''s\n  wildcard, and a wildcard certificate for a deeper name","tree":{"sha":"385612b28b7f61b7f29a20a561dca0ce4729d44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/385612b28b7f61b7f29a20a561dca0ce4729d44e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 385612b28b7f61b7f29a20a561dca0ce4729d44e\nparent a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790978134 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222997 -0500\n\ntest: prove wildcard certificates issue end to end\n\nWith wildcard admission in place, drive a DNS-proven wildcard through the\nwhole gateway reconcile: the request, the mirror and the listener. The\ncertificate service path no longer answers HTTP-01 for any hostname, so\nthe earlier guard that kept HTTP challenge answers off wildcards is gone;\na test keeps the property.\n\nKey changes:\n- request exactly one DNS-01 TLSCertificate for the wildcard and no\n  cert-manager Certificate\n- answer no HTTP challenge for a wildcard, whatever the status lists\n- admit the listener once a certificate covering the wildcard is mirrored\n- refuse a broader wildcard certificate that does not name the listener''s\n  wildcard, and a wildcard certificate for a deeper name\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPk1QAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYhRSAQC/LTL/5iKSJzQZPknNQFFXKGBXkAsnW1TzeumxayUizgEA84pTkdS3MW1c\nJmj+VMoPdc0tEylVyS8/wCCb9j1vewk=\n=rV8x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDk3MTYyNDQ4NGQ2OTQ5NWE2ZjgwYTFhNzkwMWY5Zjg2ZmM4ZjczZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6","sha":"a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6"}],"sha":"971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/971624484d69495a6f80a1a7901f9f86fc8f73e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:56:36Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:56:36Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: create the registered domain for a wildcard\n\nA wildcard with no covering Domain gets a Domain created so the user has a\nTXT record to publish. The name came from the last two labels of the base,\nso a wildcard beneath example.co.uk asked the user to prove co.uk, which no\none can.\n\nKey changes:\n- derive the Domain from the public suffix list, as Domain registration\n  already does\n- test multi-label public suffixes","tree":{"sha":"03c06c49b6e78b7f964f44ec817796926e832912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/03c06c49b6e78b7f964f44ec817796926e832912"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 03c06c49b6e78b7f964f44ec817796926e832912\nparent 949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222996 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222996 -0500\n\nfix: create the registered domain for a wildcard\n\nA wildcard with no covering Domain gets a Domain created so the user has a\nTXT record to publish. The name came from the last two labels of the base,\nso a wildcard beneath example.co.uk asked the user to prove co.uk, which no\none can.\n\nKey changes:\n- derive the Domain from the public suffix list, as Domain registration\n  already does\n- test multi-label public suffixes\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPk1AAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYq6zAQDH9+mMsKxk+RbR93iuZglhaKbEmEMMQ41A8eGQ5aMj1gEAnJKNBL5CgOm/\nvGKja4pdLZYs1SEM9gc2FuTTX9HB1AU=\n=aB/y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKGE0OGYzZmQxNmE5YTYzYjc0YWIxZjY3NTliYjYwMzEyZGIwMmMyYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b","sha":"949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b"}],"sha":"a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/a48f3fd16a9a63b74ab1f6759bb60312db02c2b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:44:47Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:44:19Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: reserve the subtree under a wildcard claim\n\nThe edge prefers an exact hostname over a wildcard, so if another project\ncould claim bucket.s3.example.com under someone''s *.s3.example.com it\nwould take that traffic. Hostname claims now cover subtrees behind the\ncertificate service flag: a wildcard reserves every name beneath it, at\nany depth, for its project.\n\nKey changes:\n- refuse a claim beneath another project''s wildcard, and a wildcard\n  while another project holds a name beneath it; the refusal names the\n  hostnames, never the project, and says reclaiming is not supported yet\n- name wildcard claims from a hash of their base, with the hostname in\n  their data, since a ConfigMap name cannot hold \"*\"; the name has no\n  dot so it never meets a custom hostname''s claim\n- find wildcards above a name with one cached GET per parent domain,\n  and names beneath a wildcard with a cache index on every parent\n  domain, so no lookup scans the claim namespace\n- re-check held claims every reconcile and keep the older of two that\n  raced, so a cache-lag race settles the same way on both sides\n- carry the refusal onto the hostname''s Available condition","tree":{"sha":"714efc807620d489af09536d758da25a765739bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/714efc807620d489af09536d758da25a765739bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3","verification":{"payload":"tree 714efc807620d489af09536d758da25a765739bf\nparent df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790977487 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222259 -0500\n\nfeat: reserve the subtree under a wildcard claim\n\nThe edge prefers an exact hostname over a wildcard, so if another project\ncould claim bucket.s3.example.com under someone''s *.s3.example.com it\nwould take that traffic. Hostname claims now cover subtrees behind the\ncertificate service flag: a wildcard reserves every name beneath it, at\nany depth, for its project.\n\nKey changes:\n- refuse a claim beneath another project''s wildcard, and a wildcard\n  while another project holds a name beneath it; the refusal names the\n  hostnames, never the project, and says reclaiming is not supported yet\n- name wildcard claims from a hash of their base, with the hostname in\n  their data, since a ConfigMap name cannot hold \"*\"; the name has no\n  dot so it never meets a custom hostname''s claim\n- find wildcards above a name with one cached GET per parent domain,\n  and names beneath a wildcard with a cache index on every parent\n  domain, so no lookup scans the claim namespace\n- re-check held claims every reconcile and keep the older of two that\n  raced, so a cache-lag race settles the same way on both sides\n- carry the refusal onto the hostname''s Available condition\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPh8wAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYuCJAP9Vwr8vGwsvMFhTzIN4f7IuKEpKMAI/JbFC5CX5ibfADwEAgfETc/OfMaKv\n1dCUwZNfIfn6qAkb2GtsEgOBR+c+pwM=\n=8JKp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDQ1ODYxMmQ1NzI1YjQ2YzkwZjQ4YzhmMzFhYWIzMDRkMTkxMzNiZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","sha":"df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8"}],"sha":"458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:48:19Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:44:19Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: admit wildcard hostnames on DNS proof\n\nTenant services that give every customer or bucket a subdomain need one\nALB to serve *.s3.example.com. Behind the certificate service flag, an\nHTTPProxy may now carry a single leading wildcard label, admitted only\nwhen its base or a parent is verified by DNS TXT record.\n\nKey changes:\n- accept \"*.\" hostnames in the HTTPProxy and Gateway webhooks and the\n  controller''s own validation when the flag is on; refuse wildcards under\n  the platform''s own domains and multi-label wildcards\n- refuse a wildcard whose covering Domain was proven over HTTP, through a\n  Datum DNS zone, or before the method was recorded, with reason\n  DNSVerificationRequired and a message naming the Domain to verify\n- create a Domain for the wildcard''s base when only a non-DNS proof\n  covers it, so the user has a TXT record to publish\n- give wildcards no grace period: one that loses its proof stops serving\n- record on the Domain which method verified it, keeping VerifiedDNS or\n  VerifiedHTTP true after verification\n- report each custom hostname''s Verified condition, and list the TXT\n  record a wildcard still needs among its DNS records","tree":{"sha":"15f94c70c2fc212d09426a5c78c4b05d0644680b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/15f94c70c2fc212d09426a5c78c4b05d0644680b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b","verification":{"payload":"tree 15f94c70c2fc212d09426a5c78c4b05d0644680b\nparent 458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790977699 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222259 -0500\n\nfeat: admit wildcard hostnames on DNS proof\n\nTenant services that give every customer or bucket a subdomain need one\nALB to serve *.s3.example.com. Behind the certificate service flag, an\nHTTPProxy may now carry a single leading wildcard label, admitted only\nwhen its base or a parent is verified by DNS TXT record.\n\nKey changes:\n- accept \"*.\" hostnames in the HTTPProxy and Gateway webhooks and the\n  controller''s own validation when the flag is on; refuse wildcards under\n  the platform''s own domains and multi-label wildcards\n- refuse a wildcard whose covering Domain was proven over HTTP, through a\n  Datum DNS zone, or before the method was recorded, with reason\n  DNSVerificationRequired and a message naming the Domain to verify\n- create a Domain for the wildcard''s base when only a non-DNS proof\n  covers it, so the user has a TXT record to publish\n- give wildcards no grace period: one that loses its proof stops serving\n- record on the Domain which method verified it, keeping VerifiedDNS or\n  VerifiedHTTP true after verification\n- report each custom hostname''s Verified condition, and list the TXT\n  record a wildcard still needs among its DNS records\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPh8wAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYq+KAQCXDw/C7zRfWbQzEmSVY1hPqJghTSsexLD+jw/XRgu6ngD8CkPsAWPm1yDK\nGEdNj1tDuCQByOhy3FSDZH0P4YLCeA8=\n=Vou2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDk0OTE3N2U4NGRlOTcxYmNmZTMwMTM1NDA2MmQ5ZjQxZWY2YWM3MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3","sha":"458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/458612d5725b46c90f48c8f31aab304d19133be3"}],"sha":"949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/949177e84de971bcfe301354062d9f41ef6ac72b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:17:35Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:44:18Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: list certificate records for wildcards only\n\nThe certificate service now issues only wildcard hostnames, so an exact\nhostname has no ACME delegation record to publish. Skip the TLSCertificate\nlookup for exact hostnames so their status lists routing and ownership\nrecords only.","tree":{"sha":"ae78db1bb93309617baba57d38e903e9d499555f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/ae78db1bb93309617baba57d38e903e9d499555f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","verification":{"payload":"tree ae78db1bb93309617baba57d38e903e9d499555f\nparent 28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790983055 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222258 -0500\n\nfix: list certificate records for wildcards only\n\nThe certificate service now issues only wildcard hostnames, so an exact\nhostname has no ACME delegation record to publish. Skip the TLSCertificate\nlookup for exact hostnames so their status lists routing and ownership\nrecords only.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPh8gAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYiw4AP9FrqvGkWmo70If91uy7gULz8DIpPE/RZTarY2ehguNawD9G0oOutbIctFd\nJuxtxytKP4pck1BZXYsVZtSI58h7+gU=\n=Dy5n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKGRmNzA1NTdhNTcwMjU5MTVkMjZmOWRmODNjZDdmZGQwMTk4NzIwYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897","sha":"28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897"}],"sha":"df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/df70557a57025915d26f9df83cd7fdd0198720c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T21:40:28Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:44:18Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: list each hostname''s DNS records on status\n\nThe portal and datumctl had no single place to learn which DNS records a\ncustom hostname still needs: the certificate CNAME lived in a condition\nmessage, the ownership TXT on the Domain, and the routing record nowhere.\nEach HTTPProxy hostname now lists the records it depends on, who publishes\nthem, and whether each takes effect, behind the certificate service flag.\n\nKey changes:\n- add hostnameStatuses[].dnsRecords with name, type, content, purpose,\n  managedBy and state\n- routing: a platform record counts only while the Datum DNS zone is the\n  one the registry delegates to; a user record counts once public DNS\n  resolves it to the canonical hostname or its addresses\n- certificate: the _acme-challenge CNAME for the hostname, present once\n  the certificate service reports the delegation resolves; records for\n  any other name in the certificate''s status are ignored\n- ownership: the pending Domain''s TXT record until a covering Domain is\n  verified\n- recheck every five minutes while a user routing record is missing,\n  with lookups cached for a minute","tree":{"sha":"9b416be03f18cae49756de69adda9c6dd1ad3142","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/9b416be03f18cae49756de69adda9c6dd1ad3142"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b416be03f18cae49756de69adda9c6dd1ad3142\nparent 418a67494a359d75e349219ddf81ac6a4ab1c4c8\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790977228 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1791222258 -0500\n\nfeat: list each hostname''s DNS records on status\n\nThe portal and datumctl had no single place to learn which DNS records a\ncustom hostname still needs: the certificate CNAME lived in a condition\nmessage, the ownership TXT on the Domain, and the routing record nowhere.\nEach HTTPProxy hostname now lists the records it depends on, who publishes\nthem, and whether each takes effect, behind the certificate service flag.\n\nKey changes:\n- add hostnameStatuses[].dnsRecords with name, type, content, purpose,\n  managedBy and state\n- routing: a platform record counts only while the Datum DNS zone is the\n  one the registry delegates to; a user record counts once public DNS\n  resolves it to the canonical hostname or its addresses\n- certificate: the _acme-challenge CNAME for the hostname, present once\n  the certificate service reports the delegation resolves; records for\n  any other name in the certificate''s status are ignored\n- ownership: the pending Domain''s TXT record until a covering Domain is\n  verified\n- recheck every five minutes while a user routing record is missing,\n  with lookups cached for a minute\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCasPh8gAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYo3/APsECDrEot6BfFkyo5fUr8pcA7AuVv/p3oQfXr2TtZrGTQEAtRs93OTm04xE\nnO/NRaQ3dBVSRz34K5ClGrdmjFOdDAA=\n=sW30\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:57:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDI4ZDYwYTFkZTEzNGU3YjBjYWRlZTdlZjI3MzE4ODU3ODQ2Mzk4OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/418a67494a359d75e349219ddf81ac6a4ab1c4c8","sha":"418a67494a359d75e349219ddf81ac6a4ab1c4c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/418a67494a359d75e349219ddf81ac6a4ab1c4c8"}],"sha":"28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/28d60a1de134e7b0cadee7ef2731885784639897"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/ed6cf8ec0595c1cea29ebe33f87a2af60e8e8f44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:42:25Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:07:01Z","email":"vvoytovych@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Voytovych"},"message":"fix: Leave a gateway''s v4. and v6. names to external-dns\n\nexternal-dns publishes A and AAAA records at a gateway''s own names from its\nDNSEndpoint. Gateway DNS skipped only the canonical name, so it also wrote a\nCNAME or ALIAS at the v4. and v6. forms. On staging PowerDNS then refused\nthe address records, and in production the v4. name answered IPv6 too.\n\nGateway DNS now skips every name the gateway owns, with the check hostname\nclaims already use, and docs/architecture/gateway-dns-names.md states which\ncomponent writes which name.","tree":{"sha":"7db80e60c58353938bc1f046daa863e5901beae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/7db80e60c58353938bc1f046daa863e5901beae6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/ed6cf8ec0595c1cea29ebe33f87a2af60e8e8f44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1584134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vvoytovych","id":1584134,"login":"vvoytovych","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vvoytovych/repos","site_admin":fals