"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/663948597ac930db0a5673a189d271f65f7a41cb","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDY2Mzk0ODU5N2FjOTMwZGIwYTU2NzNhMTg5ZDI3MWY2NWY3YTQxY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/aec07fa9d071e10291a3573ada3db5d75a5bc7ec","sha":"aec07fa9d071e10291a3573ada3db5d75a5bc7ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/aec07fa9d071e10291a3573ada3db5d75a5bc7ec"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8","sha":"1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8"}],"sha":"663948597ac930db0a5673a189d271f65f7a41cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/663948597ac930db0a5673a189d271f65f7a41cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:14:50Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T17:14:50Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: Make the alb plugin installable before the catalog\n\nThe documented install paths did not work. `datumctl plugin install\ndatum-cloud/network-services-operator@<tag>` derives the archive name from\nthe repository name, so it fetches `datumctl-network-services-operator_*`\nand this repository publishes `datumctl-alb_*`. `make install-plugin` wrote\nthe binary to `~/.datumctl/plugins/alb`, and datumctl refuses a short-named\nplugin in that directory unless `plugins.json` holds an install record for\nit, which only `datumctl plugin install` writes and `plugin trust` does not.\nSo the only two working paths were undocumented.\n\nThe release archives also carried no license text, which an AGPL-3.0 binary\nshould ship.\n\nKey changes:\n- Install as `datumctl-alb` in the managed directory, which datumctl runs\n  without an install record\n- Document that path, the equivalent from a release archive, and the\n  PATH-plus-trust alternative, replacing the command that cannot resolve\n- Ship LICENSE and README.md in the archives by dropping the `none*` glob,\n  matching how the compute plugin releases\n- Record that only the first catalog entry is manual, since every release\n  after it updates the index through `update-plugin-index`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f35c8352be6367593fcf157121257d10fa48348","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/trees/4f35c8352be6367593fcf157121257d10fa48348"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/git/commits/1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f35c8352be6367593fcf157121257d10fa48348\nparent 4502a6586bd07e4085e59bd9762bf9cbcbfb4c2f\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790356490 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790356490 -0500\n\nfix: Make the alb plugin installable before the catalog\n\nThe documented install paths did not work. `datumctl plugin install\ndatum-cloud/network-services-operator@<tag>` derives the archive name from\nthe repository name, so it fetches `datumctl-network-services-operator_*`\nand this repository publishes `datumctl-alb_*`. `make install-plugin` wrote\nthe binary to `~/.datumctl/plugins/alb`, and datumctl refuses a short-named\nplugin in that directory unless `plugins.json` holds an install record for\nit, which only `datumctl plugin install` writes and `plugin trust` does not.\nSo the only two working paths were undocumented.\n\nThe release archives also carried no license text, which an AGPL-3.0 binary\nshould ship.\n\nKey changes:\n- Install as `datumctl-alb` in the managed directory, which datumctl runs\n  without an install record\n- Document that path, the equivalent from a release archive, and the\n  PATH-plus-trust alternative, replacing the command that cannot resolve\n- Ship LICENSE and README.md in the archives by dropping the `none*` glob,\n  matching how the compute plugin releases\n- Record that only the first catalog entry is manual, since every release\n  after it updates the index through `update-plugin-index`\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCarasCgAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYgEcAP9vPB66tOk1d0s3kSQ5NYkmYfTDhpwS1Wf0iMZv8iE2lgD9E6510wrdG1J9\nkKiviYDPJBDT6yMBQN0B4p7WMI8+QwI=\n=RHNK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T17:15:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8","node_id":"C_kwDONOR9G9oAKDFkNTIzOWMxNjM3Y2ZmMTE5NDdiNmYyNDQ2MTNlMTlhNTVhZDY3ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commit/4502a6586bd07e4085e59bd9762bf9cbcbfb4c2f","sha":"4502a6586bd07e4085e59bd9762bf9cbcbfb4c2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/4502a6586bd07e4085e59bd9762bf9cbcbfb4c2f"}],"sha":"1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/network-services-operator/commits/1d5239c1637cff11947b6f244613e19a55ad67e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com