il.com","name":"Griff"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T01:42:46Z","email":"grifftatarsky@gmail.com","name":"Griff"},"message":"Optimize Ooze builds and add blog metadata\n\nThis change trims the Ooze remote build by using an explicit federation share list, swapping the Babylon inspector out in production, and dropping redundant no-op Babylon imports. It also adds a blog post head endpoint and tests for server-rendered Open Graph metadata so crawlers can read article titles, summaries, and canonical URLs without running the app.","tree":{"sha":"0fbe38c9ea159aa98ac8758daeff51f575e040ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grifftatarsky/akira-platform/git/trees/0fbe38c9ea159aa98ac8758daeff51f575e040ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grifftatarsky/akira-platform/git/commits/772382ab0d14b8359511d74203060666a258086a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52219673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/grifftatarsky","id":52219673,"login":"grifftatarsky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjE5Njcz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/grifftatarsky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/grifftata