 Node 20+ and the project is\non Node 18 (frontend-maven-plugin).\n\nVerified with yarn build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b465109ee9027f05b950230a779e72c6daef69ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/force-publish-all/git/trees/b465109ee9027f05b950230a779e72c6daef69ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/force-publish-all/git/commits/3f9a5fefd55405c36b1a2f3a1fe22b981e322022","verification":{"payload":"tree b465109ee9027f05b950230a779e72c6daef69ba\nparent 7e2a1183e1993ff051776f468684451df16b8661\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779963008 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779963008 +0200\n\nAddress Dependabot high-severity alerts in yarn.lock\n\n- Bump @jahia/moonstone 2.5.12 -> 2.11.3 (last React 16 compatible)\n- Bump @jahia/ui-extender 1.0.10 -> 1.3.0\n- Bump @jahia/eslint-config 1.1.0 -> 2.2.0\n- Pin packageManager=yarn@1.22.22 (matches frontend-maven-plugin)\n- Add resolutions to force safe transitive deps:\n  braces ^3.0.3, flatted ^3.4.2, form-data ^3.0.4, lodash ^4.18.1,\n  minimatch ^3.1.3, node-fetch ^2.6.7, rollup ^2.80.0, tmp ^0.2.6\n\nCloses 9 of 10 alerts. serialize-javascript remains pinned at 6.0.2\nbecause the patched 7.0.3+ line requires Node 20+ and the project is\non Node 18 (frontend-maven-plugin).\n\nVerified with yarn build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoYFIAACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3k3Ygf9HHKMS/k0jlJx30yyyG1QbTgM5Z3Mtxs0KVm13QRkvtCHhNjyQoQO+RUS\nLlFkFZ3/KeMqLmEpjgi1XMlNJ7JeamG1xUoq5OfIEDjmKveY8tnLfsjdqNEme0i0\npeos5bsufo2kCWfdtRKBLCHQ//tMIWlnmkyHYuoMM/tt4UhFy+5CiJAjhg837Poq\noxlhgUMQ247jLjyhJk6X1PpTF0QqRVD9dFjUVEa4KP6e1DVVQENJ48g3GwRBtEug\nMrgAtjfQGpKxcC1RHWqeXcYECi6rvhOh8W0v2ElNwJOcHTrpAc/R/YwVjgZkO2co\nPvwsahA7kfbl6heakKrocI54VX/s5Q==\n=bJDb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-28T11:01: