true P2P event management plugin:\n\n- Remove entire backend server (Express, Prisma, PostgreSQL)\n- Replace axios with Gun.js for all data operations\n- Add real-time event updates via Gun.js subscriptions\n- Create useEventGun composable for P2P event management\n- Update all views to use Gun.js instead of backend APIs\n- Add proper module federation setup with PluginMain router\n- Update build configuration to output to dist/\n- Add comprehensive P2P documentation in README\n\nFeatures preserved:\n- Event creation with date/time picker\n- Recurring events (weekly, bi-weekly, monthly)\n- Join/leave functionality with real-time updates\n- Participant limits\n- Interest and location tagging\n- Beautiful UI with Tailwind CSS\n\nThis plugin now serves as an exemplary P2P plugin implementation\nfollowing Tribelike''s vision of decentralized social networking.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b6b9ff853466115af6d80a7bed3c3aad4451015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/event-plugin/git/trees/7b6b9ff853466115af6d80a7bed3c3aad4451015"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toplocs/event-plugin/git/commits/07ad67abbf9e3296768a4cdc4c5d475549212b27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/214010?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelstingl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelstingl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelstingl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelstingl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelstingl","id":214010,"login":"michaelstingl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNDAxMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelstingl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelstingl/received_event