n"},"message":"feat(ui): Condense the workloads list and match the portal''s tables\n\n- Table is the default view, with Name, Status, CPU, Memory and Locations\n  columns, so it fits without horizontal scrolling.\n- Sortable headers use the portal''s chevron header instead of datum-ui''s\n  ColumnHeader, which made the header taller and used different icons.\n- Locations stays on one line: least healthy region plus a +N count, with\n  every region in a tooltip.\n- Status badge uses the portal''s small caps status style.\n- Table and cards list workloads newest first.","tree":{"sha":"4f091c2c39cbffac6e43b1258723ca81f49c6b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/4f091c2c39cbffac6e43b1258723ca81f49c6b72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/15787bcc18068db26e62138ad1a67ea000ae0036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gith