h in the portal\n\nThe plugin inherits cloud-portal''s query defaults, so workloads stayed\nstale after a tab switch, an approved Compute entitlement kept the gate\nlocked until a reload, and demo create or delete left the portal''s ALB\nand Domains pages out of date. Polled queries now refetch on focus, the\nentitlement query polls until Active and then refreshes the portal''s\ngate, and workload writes invalidate the portal''s affected lists.","tree":{"sha":"38c0e3e77d48df6b2c2c37639e3c68ed185f1564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/38c0e3e77d48df6b2c2c37639e3c68ed185f1564"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/abc0433c0f027058e2b76d6952087ed87cef6d30","verification":{"payload":"tree 38c0e3e77d48df6b2c2c37639e3c68ed185f1564\nparent a377619ffde39f6ae3434ca1ec6ce6df03acd929\nauthor Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791191538 +0700\ncommitter Yahya Fakhroji <yahya.fakhroji@gmail.com> 1791253482 +0700\n\nfix(ui): Keep workloads and the compute gate fresh in the portal\n\nThe plugin inherits cloud-portal''s query defaults, so workloads stayed\nstale after a tab switch, an approved Compute entitlement kept the gate\nlocked until a reload, and demo create or delete left the portal''s ALB\nand Domains pages out of date. Polled queries now refetch on focus, the\nentitlement query polls until Active and then refreshes the portal''s\ngate, and workload writes invalidate the portal''s affected lists.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMx73jwm6xkYPRZJCQ276hNnNDiMFAmrEW+obFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEENu+oTZzQ4jJoUQAKZisEhgNTIXvz9ETPTc\nFMMXNyL1QBg9d7G0KKcbc2zpwDpqyQ9TG7Ydge7rahNhjm0ur5DTJSfFXaYwe7QV\nyUcIn+vOuC/xwNRxkUWtBsN0ZJsllskswOlSsI2o8ZdTpBU99bjP2UJBPaOhtREb\nuCT1JNqylsjVOYc28EO6aN+hMcnVDKSWEyebJe5l/JYILLTl+HEGDOm8z6YCGGK7\n91uyYE1rc3pjWgzIkCsJAtyvjoDb7TlrrEmwMKDBPRGUg0On5OlKAv55li9t3iNj\nw8xf6M7hU7tHkgKzwGl3eel8sEwVXcfauogWPZQ1AY4txoIZxs75