":"2026-10-05T11:32:55Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat(ui): Show workload URL and a Visit action\n\nOnce a workload was deployed it wasn''t obvious how to reach it. The\ndefault ALB hostname only appeared as grey secondary text in the\nhealth strip, truncated on mobile, and the strip''s one button\n(\"View ALB\") opened the load balancer''s settings rather than the app.\n\nThe detail header now shows the hostname as plain, selectable text\nbeside the workload''s name, on every tab, with a Visit button next to\nDelete. Visit links only once the workload and its load balancer are\nserving; until then it is disabled with the reason. Workload cards\nshow the hostname as a link, since they have no Visit button.\n\nThe header holds the URL and Visit/Delete in place while their data\nloads, so nothing shifts in. On narrow screens the topology stacks\ninto one column at its natural size, with no pan or zoom, instead of\nshrinking the side-by-side tree until it clipped.\n\nResolves: #424\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"708e5484280cbc89809a0dba2406da9c1c728ad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/708e5484280cbc89809a0dba2406da9c1c728ad1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/fa27c11b8ed5821e0392395407d2ffaf7d439795","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MD