ithub.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/8271b8473203f56807e501d9167e54deb736346c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:24:58Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:24:58Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat(ui): Show deploying and load balancer provisioning states\n\nA new workload read as red Unavailable while it was still coming up: the\nWorkload API reports Available=False with a transient reason during\nrollout, and the plugin treated any False as a failure.\n\nWorkloads now show Deploying, with the current step and elapsed time,\nand warn when waiting on quota or still deploying after two minutes.\nFailing instances (bad image, crash loop, configuration error) override\nthat on the detail page. Attached load balancers show whether they are\nprovisioning or failing, classified the way network-services-operator''s\ncondition catalog does. While either is coming up the page polls every\n3s, and the topology holds its shape with placeholder instances so\nnothing jumps as resources appear.\n\nCloses #425","tree":{"sha":"f98544688a626d37141737424a89b5803ccccee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/f98544688a626d37141737424a89b5803ccccee4"},"url":"ht