,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/d11faa734b3697cbd3d1bf13b25351d3c7cfe0f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:16:07Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:16:07Z","email":"75292329+mattdjenkinson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Matt Jenkinson"},"message":"feat: Put the terminal first on the instance shell\n\nThe Shell tab read as a form: a card, a bordered start panel and a\ndashed placeholder, with the terminal only appearing after Connect and\nthe layout jumping when it did. The pop-out window stacked a title bar\nover a session bar.\n\nThe shell is now one frame from the start: a thin toolbar over a black\nterminal surface. Before a session the toolbar holds the container, a\nfixed-width command field with sh and bash presets in a menu, an icon\npop-out button and Connect. During a session the same row shows a\nstatus dot, the container and command, and Close shell, so connecting\nno longer shifts the page. Idle, opening, not-running and ended states\nare messages inside the terminal surface instead of separate boxes.\n\nIn the pop-out window the toolbar shares the header row with the\ninstance name, and the workload and location move into a tooltip.\n\nKey changes:\n- Replace the start panel, session line and empty state with one\n  toolbar and terminal frame\n- Show the container as text when the instance has only one\n- Draw the command input''s frame-free styles inline, since the portal\n  can put the datum-ui Input border back inside an input group\n- Colour text on the terminal inline, since the portal only generates\n  Tailwind classes it uses itself\n- Swap the status badge for a dot and drop the badge theme it needed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"786ebc3e3d8ac588540e3f05da5499ca3a883d4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/786ebc3e3d8ac588540e3f05da5499ca3a883d4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/d11faa734b3697cbd3d1bf13b25351d3c7cfe0f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users