ing\nagainst the 3.x type scale anyway. This brings the source in line with\nwhat renders.\n\nKey changes:\n- Bump datum-ui to ^3.4.0 in ui/consumer (from ^2.9.1) and ui/provider\n  (from ^2.10.0)\n- Rename the 9px text-2xs to text-5xs, since 3.0 reused text-2xs for 12px\n- Bump motion to ^13 in both plugins to meet datum-ui''s peer range\n- Raise js-yaml to ^5.4.1 in ui/provider to meet datum-ui''s new peer\n  floor (GHSA-r3ph-w7gj-g6xm)\n\nThe Module Federation shared config is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"feea6f715af3b9effa0b34c2b61c459103bcd845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/feea6f715af3b9effa0b34c2b61c459103bcd845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/0db53daefa2896af1d46e305fb874cee6ef21bb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/0db53daefa2896af1d46e305fb874cee6ef21bb3","no