ploy''s NetworkService update could fail with \"the object has been\nmodified\" when the controller wrote status between the CLI''s read and\nwrite. The window was hit on every deploy: the API defaults\ntrafficDistribution, which the CLI never sets, so the built spec never\nmatched the stored one and every deploy rewrote the service.\n\nMerge the fields a deploy owns (selector and ports) onto the existing\nservice so an unchanged deploy is a no-op, and retry both the service\nand proxy writes on conflict with a fresh read.\n\nFixes #393","tree":{"sha":"b0f9acc8a769a307569ff47c50c2240fff8f155b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/b0f9acc8a769a307569ff47c50c2240fff8f155b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/6e6f1bff6f8cd6f43ee90cbaa255e63ae8cecff0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75292329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattdjenkinson","id":75292329,"login":"mattdjenkinson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjkyMzI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattdjenkinson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commi