organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/e85e40ba1831f67d15a930732f99425185310f66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:10:10Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:10:10Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"feat: Open shell sessions to every project by default\n\nShell sessions shipped off for every project until it got a quota grant.\nProduction now allows up to ten open sessions per project by default, so\nanyone who can create sessions can open a shell without a grant.\n\nKey changes:\n- Raise the default shell session limit from zero to ten per project\n- Describe the new default in the design doc\n\nA grant still raises or lowers the limit for one project.","tree":{"sha":"b7862fcee737e611c8b6741e06b8e7e424fa34f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/b7862fcee737e611c8b6741e06b8e7e424fa34f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/e85e40ba1831f67d15a930732f99425185310f66","verification":{"payload":"tree b7862fcee737e611c8b6741e06b8e7e424fa34f4\nparent 8735f874c2ab6ef6df214fdeaf32ec16c74e9ade\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790817010 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790817010 -0500\n\nfeat: Open shell sessions to every project by default\n\nShell sessions shipped off for every project until it got a quota grant.\nProduction now allows up to ten open sessions per project by default, so\nanyone who can create sessions can open a shell without a grant.\n\nKey changes:\n- Raise the default shell session limit from zero to ten per project\n- Describe the new default in the design doc\n\nA grant still raises or lowers the limit for one project.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCar2y8gAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYoSmAP4zOjFdMh0v0T3ik/IxyKURb3A30J6naYkyogqRqVFQugD+P9mKi/PFsNcO\nCaE+ecrIi1UoGYSBK06qCXnnc2rIpAc=\n=q49J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T01:10:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/e85e40ba1831f67d15a930732f99425185310f66","node_id":"C_kwDONRbpCNoAKGU4NWU0MGJhMTgzMWY2N2QxNWE5MzA3MzJmOTk0MjUxODUzMTBmNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/8735f874c2ab6ef6df214fdeaf32ec16c74e9ade","sha":"8735f874c2ab6ef6df214fdeaf32ec16c74e9ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/8735f874c2ab6ef6df214fdeaf32ec16c74e9ade"}],"sha":"e85e40ba1831f67d15a930732f99425185310f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/e85e40ba1831f67d15a930732f99425185310f66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/f69c200d9f285e8f8df2eab2d2f7e0189d456da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:01:18Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:01:18Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"Add observability for Instance shell sessions\n\nAdds session metrics to the control plane and shell agent, enables the agent metrics server with a scrape target, and stamps cell and location on session activity events and logs so support can go from one project event to the cell that served it.\n\nShips a Grafana dashboard as grafonnet source with the rendered JSON packaged as a kustomize component for the Grafana operator, six alert rules with runbooks, and a CI drift check for the rendered dashboard. Records the monitoring design in the enhancement.\n\nRefs #399\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02298729255ed969fae1bdd51a030650ce37404e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/02298729255ed969fae1bdd51a030650ce37404e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/f69c200d9f285e8f8df2eab2d2f7e0189d456da6","verification":{"payload":"tree 02298729255ed969fae1bdd51a030650ce37404e\nparent 2aa721fd19a3a21d461d509d7c871e405df991be\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790812878 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790812878 -0500\n\nAdd observability for Instance shell sessions\n\nAdds session metrics to the control plane and shell agent, enables the agent metrics server with a scrape target, and stamps cell and location on session activity events and logs so support can go from one project event to the cell that served it.\n\nShips a Grafana dashboard as grafonnet source with the rendered JSON packaged as a kustomize component for the Grafana operator, six alert rules with runbooks, and a CI drift check for the rendered dashboard. Records the monitoring design in the enhancement.\n\nRefs #399\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCar2izgAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYmygAP9FiY1jaLgQHPBJez6JTG3GcL/YCKYSiTC5qs2gdCXghQEAiLhuWwciixUG\nG9TatOEYBPH4m4zNnMAn3niPhk7TwAo=\n=BAHm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T00:01:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097