:"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/4350a57cc177bffe8228b12e631c5d03e53b0cec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:13:33Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:13:33Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: Refuse client-set compute metadata on shell sessions\n\nCompute''s controllers and cell agents read labels and annotations in the\ncompute.datumapis.com namespace, and its subdomains, on sessions. A\nclient could set them at creation, since admission checked only the\nspec.\n\nAdmission now refuses any such label or annotation on create, in both the\nmutating and validating webhooks, except the requester annotation, which\nadmission overwrites. Customers cannot update sessions, so create is the\nonly request that needs the check.","tree":{"sha":"fd3e82f5864f101dff45cd54ffcf275eb971aad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/fd3e82f5864f101dff45cd54ffcf275eb971aad0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/4350a57cc177bffe8228b12e631c5d03e53b0cec","verification":{"payload":"tree fd3e82f5864f101dff45cd54ffcf275eb971aad0\nparent 3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790792013 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790792013 -0500\n\nfix: Refuse client-set compute metadata on shell sessions\n\nCompute''s controllers and cell agents read labels and annotations in the\ncompute.datumapis.com namespace, and its subdomains, on sessions. A\nclient could set them at creation, since admission checked only the\nspec.\n\nAdmission now refuses any such label or annotation on create, in both the\nmutating and validating webhooks, except the requester annotation, which\nadmission overwrites. Customers cannot update sessions, so create is the\nonly request that needs the check.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCar1RTQAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYrd4AQDYiAAL9pFX/5nif4eaHmZNmauTBT7Za1i5um+jNIN8SwEAibBdmfyJK/xd\nj7IzGxGzPBhovqKn7TyrJv/aIV8dhAc=\n=uUaB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T18:13:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/4350a57cc177bffe8228b12e631c5d03e53b0cec","node_id":"C_kwDONRbpCNoAKDQzNTBhNTdjYzE3N2JmZmU4MjI4YjEyZTYzMWM1ZDAzZTUzYjBjZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764","sha":"3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764"}],"sha":"4350a57cc177bffe8228b12e631c5d03e53b0cec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/4350a57cc177bffe8228b12e631c5d03e53b0cec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:13:33Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T18:13:33Z","email":"wells.scot@gmail.com","name":"Scot Wells"},"message":"fix: Track recorded session events in status\n\nThe previous change marked each recorded lifecycle event with an\nannotation on the project session. A requester could set that annotation\nwhen creating the session, and the controller then never recorded the\nsession''s start or end, keeping it out of the project''s activity.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add status.recordedEvents, which only the control plane writes. No\n  customer role grants update, patch or updateStatus on sessions.\n- Claim each event there with an optimistic-concurrency status update\n  before recording it, and mark it recorded afterwards, retrying that\n  mark on conflict.\n- Keep recordedEvents when copying the cell''s status, and leave it out\n  of the comparison so an unchanged cell status is not rewritten.\n- Test that annotations a requester sets do not suppress either event.","tree":{"sha":"adca734f24be08772a89b3e62fbfb0ef035052f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/trees/adca734f24be08772a89b3e62fbfb0ef035052f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/git/commits/3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764","verification":{"payload":"tree adca734f24be08772a89b3e62fbfb0ef035052f8\nparent 4e0c0ae9b58d2a776ec6f289b72ddb390cbf7236\nauthor Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790792013 -0500\ncommitter Scot Wells <wells.scot@gmail.com> 1790792013 -0500\n\nfix: Track recorded session events in status\n\nThe previous change marked each recorded lifecycle event with an\nannotation on the project session. A requester could set that annotation\nwhen creating the session, and the controller then never recorded the\nsession''s start or end, keeping it out of the project''s activity.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add status.recordedEvents, which only the control plane writes. No\n  customer role grants update, patch or updateStatus on sessions.\n- Claim each event there with an optimistic-concurrency status update\n  before recording it, and mark it recorded afterwards, retrying that\n  mark on conflict.\n- Keep recordedEvents when copying the cell''s status, and leave it out\n  of the comparison so an unchanged cell status is not rewritten.\n- Test that annotations a requester sets do not suppress either event.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQR/ozPp/oJ2P+NplhUmONarzn3cYgUCar1RTQAKCRAmONarzn3c\nYqjuAPwMmTftfaSbsotx66wloZ9FXOVy5y9QNryGE2VpqCzh4gD+MAkv3mlT/eXN\nAWoIzAUcN+ijc7pircQu8EOykf0ARQ4=\n=A5Ks\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T18:13:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6007097?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/scotwells","id":6007097,"login":"scotwells","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDcwOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scotwells","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764","node_id":"C_kwDONRbpCNoAKDNhMzNlODc5M2UwYzRlNWFjNTcyMGM3ZTA5MzcwYzI2MWQ5OGI3NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datum-cloud/compute/commit/4e0c0ae9b58d2a776ec6f289b72ddb390cbf7236","sha":"4e0c0ae9b58d2a776ec6f289b72ddb390cbf7236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/4e0c0ae9b58d2a776ec6f289b72ddb390cbf7236"}],"sha":"3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits/3a33e8793e0c4e5ac5720c7e09370c261d98b764"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/datum-cloud/compute/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=38b7d8ae1ad18b8ad87be4117f604d813e32c2ec&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A41%3A03.342Z"}');
