2-p8h4-qcjw\n\nbrace-expansion: Zero-step sequence causes process hang and memory exhaustion - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-f886-m6hf-6m8v\n\nform-data: CRLF injection in form-data via unescaped multipart field names and filenames - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-hmw2-7cc7-3qxx\n\nPostCSS has XSS via Unescaped </style> in its CSS Stringify Output - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qx2v-qp2m-jg93\n\njs-yaml has prototype pollution in merge (<<) - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mh29-5h37-fv8m\nJS-YAML: Quadratic-complexity DoS in merge key handling via repeated aliases - https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-h67p-54hq-rp68","tree":{"sha":"9af3a16d971510e84063f0cb246c9a72ebaa6909","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TourmalineCore/inner-circle-layout-ui/git/trees/9af3a16d971510e84063f0cb246c9a72ebaa6909"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TourmalineCore/inner-circle-layout-ui/git/commits/b6915543987e3bdb3c17ae7019d1b41c64db8055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75628188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MDI74","id":75628188,"login":"MDI74","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI4MTg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MDI74","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.co