uthoredDate":"2026-08-31T12:55:14Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T12:55:14Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","repositoryId":890952056,"sha":"e6f5dbd981e97a9aaabe4c4822604d80695c01a4"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"rappm","providerType":"User"},"email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-31T12:48:12Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T12:48:12Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","repositoryId":890952056,"sha":"570d3c5f979bb1e156f54cf25f31d4c7afa60cab"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"renovate[bot]","providerType":"Bot"},"email":"29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"renovate[bot]"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-31T09:52:32Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T09:52:32Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","repositoryId":890952056,"sha":"13199299043b62711f8bf9965597fb7b657fda0b"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"rappm","providerType":"User"},"email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-31T09:21:45Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T09:21:45Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","repositoryId":890952056,"sha":"b8ccaa533a3502b607154b4a517c81abc53a4cd0"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"rappm","providerType":"User"},"email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-31T09:00:11Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T09:00:11Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","repositoryId":890952056,"sha":"81cc8c8a94e941f7815f43418629affd97a40fa6"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"rappm","providerType":"User"},"email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-31T08:59:09Z","committedDate":"2026-08-31T08:59:09Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","repositoryId":890952056,"sha":"038cabb0ab5b7736ce88c29ed0884b7e9f79670f"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:35:51.852Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53191688?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/d7ca1b5e0f2c6769018eccec09dfa17e2e13d872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:46:22Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:46:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"General: Fix the open Dependabot alerts (#2295)\n\n* Dependencies: Patch the vulnerable transitive client packages\n\nMove the transitive packages behind the open Dependabot alerts in\nclients/yarn.lock to fixed releases within their parents'' existing ranges:\n\n- nx and @nx/devkit 23.1.1 -> 23.2.1 (GHSA-w3vv-58gj-gw77, GHSA-hrvq-x7jp-36xv)\n- prosemirror-view 1.40.1 / 1.41.8 / 1.42.3 -> 1.42.6, collapsed onto one entry\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 -> 1.2.2\n- http-cache-semantics 4.2.0 -> 4.3.0 (GHSA-ch52-4w7c-c8xp)\n\nprosemirror-view 1.42.6 asks for prosemirror-model ^1.25.12, which would have\ninstalled a fourth model copy next to the tiptap schema''s 1.25.11. The editor\nthen mixes Fragments from two copies, so pasting nested HTML throws and the\nclipboard attribute checks from 1.42.3 no longer run. Every range accepts\n1.25.12, so prosemirror-model is deduped onto that single copy. This also\nremoves the existing 1.25.2 and 1.25.7 duplicates that already broke the\neditor''s list and blockquote wrap commands.\n\n* Dependencies: Remove the unused Tailwind typography plugin\n\n@tailwindcss/typography 0.5.20, the latest release, pins\npostcss-selector-parser to exactly 6.0.10. GHSA-rj75-hqrm-r3gf affects every\nrelease below 7.1.6 and the 6.x line has no fixed release.\n\nThe plugin only provides the prose classes, and no client nor\n@tumaet/prompt-ui-components uses them: the core stylesheet contains no prose\nrules with or without it. Removing it closes the alert without a resolution\nthat would keep overriding the plugin''s own pin.\n\n* Dependencies: Patch the vulnerable transitive docs packages\n\nMove the transitive packages behind the open Dependabot alerts in\ndocs/yarn.lock to fixed releases within their parents'' existing ranges:\n\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 -> 2.0.8\n- compression 1.8.1 -> 1.8.2\n- joi 17.13.7 -> 17.13.8\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 -> 1.2.2\n- http-cache-semantics 4.2.0 -> 4.3.0 (GHSA-ch52-4w7c-c8xp)\n\n* Dependencies: Resolve tinypool and postcss-selector-parser in the docs\n\nNeither package has a fixed release inside the range its parent asks for:\n\n- @docusaurus/core 3.10.2, the latest release, requires tinypool ^1.0.2, but\n  GHSA-5gmw-xhrv-c9v3 and GHSA-85c8-ppgw-ccpr are only fixed in 2.1.1 and\n  2.1.2. The 2.0 major only drops Node 18, and the docs require Node 24.\n- The cssnano 6 plugins (postcss-calc, postcss-discard-unused,\n  postcss-merge-rules, postcss-minify-selectors, postcss-unique-selectors,\n  stylehacks) require postcss-selector-parser ^6, but GHSA-rj75-hqrm-r3gf is\n  only fixed in 7.1.6 and the 6.x line has no fixed release.\n\nEach resolution is scoped to the parents that need it, so no other consumer\nis moved across a major version. future.v4 turns on the SSG worker threads\nthat load tinypool once a site passes about 100 pages; the build succeeds\nwith the pool forced on through DOCUSAURUS_SSG_WORKER_THREAD_COUNT=2.","tree":{"sha":"decb3f3fae313ec28984f78ebfad61e485f3c241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/decb3f3fae313ec28984f78ebfad61e485f3c241"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/d7ca1b5e0f2c6769018eccec09dfa17e2e13d872","verification":{"payload":"tree decb3f3fae313ec28984f78ebfad61e485f3c241\nparent 65e5a4713551920fb2b0face0d8bc64cfecd0e6e\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791445582 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791445582 +0200\n\nGeneral: Fix the open Dependabot alerts (#2295)\n\n* Dependencies: Patch the vulnerable transitive client packages\n\nMove the transitive packages behind the open Dependabot alerts in\nclients/yarn.lock to fixed releases within their parents'' existing ranges:\n\n- nx and @nx/devkit 23.1.1 -> 23.2.1 (GHSA-w3vv-58gj-gw77, GHSA-hrvq-x7jp-36xv)\n- prosemirror-view 1.40.1 / 1.41.8 / 1.42.3 -> 1.42.6, collapsed onto one entry\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 -> 1.2.2\n- http-cache-semantics 4.2.0 -> 4.3.0 (GHSA-ch52-4w7c-c8xp)\n\nprosemirror-view 1.42.6 asks for prosemirror-model ^1.25.12, which would have\ninstalled a fourth model copy next to the tiptap schema''s 1.25.11. The editor\nthen mixes Fragments from two copies, so pasting nested HTML throws and the\nclipboard attribute checks from 1.42.3 no longer run. Every range accepts\n1.25.12, so prosemirror-model is deduped onto that single copy. This also\nremoves the existing 1.25.2 and 1.25.7 duplicates that already broke the\neditor''s list and blockquote wrap commands.\n\n* Dependencies: Remove the unused Tailwind typography plugin\n\n@tailwindcss/typography 0.5.20, the latest release, pins\npostcss-selector-parser to exactly 6.0.10. GHSA-rj75-hqrm-r3gf affects every\nrelease below 7.1.6 and the 6.x line has no fixed release.\n\nThe plugin only provides the prose classes, and no client nor\n@tumaet/prompt-ui-components uses them: the core stylesheet contains no prose\nrules with or without it. Removing it closes the alert without a resolution\nthat would keep overriding the plugin''s own pin.\n\n* Dependencies: Patch the vulnerable transitive docs packages\n\nMove the transitive packages behind the open Dependabot alerts in\ndocs/yarn.lock to fixed releases within their parents'' existing ranges:\n\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 -> 2.0.8\n- compression 1.8.1 -> 1.8.2\n- joi 17.13.7 -> 17.13.8\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 -> 1.2.2\n- http-cache-semantics 4.2.0 -> 4.3.0 (GHSA-ch52-4w7c-c8xp)\n\n* Dependencies: Resolve tinypool and postcss-selector-parser in the docs\n\nNeither package has a fixed release inside the range its parent asks for:\n\n- @docusaurus/core 3.10.2, the latest release, requires tinypool ^1.0.2, but\n  GHSA-5gmw-xhrv-c9v3 and GHSA-85c8-ppgw-ccpr are only fixed in 2.1.1 and\n  2.1.2. The 2.0 major only drops Node 18, and the docs require Node 24.\n- The cssnano 6 plugins (postcss-calc, postcss-discard-unused,\n  postcss-merge-rules, postcss-minify-selectors, postcss-unique-selectors,\n  stylehacks) require postcss-selector-parser ^6, but GHSA-rj75-hqrm-r3gf is\n  only fixed in 7.1.6 and the 6.x line has no fixed release.\n\nEach resolution is scoped to the parents that need it, so no other consumer\nis moved across a major version. future.v4 turns on the SSG worker threads\nthat load tinypool once a site passes about 100 pages; the build succeeds\nwith the pool forced on through DOCUSAURUS_SSG_WORKER_THREAD_COUNT=2.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx0pOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/RMQAKPzJK2LU55yndkrrA+ovK0K\n0xb0D1ZPXO7K+/9Uc20D/gB0Bn4HPYiRZ3GPvmeyf869NFRunA2ZbL3WPF3sn5nk\n/2rPsDiJ+yzPNpOwF3Hyfl9hFED1flOO/inqV5r0DJeF+mW9xCAPjesHujEe0rt7\n6izqVMpG3Dz0z2MsviVr0RQa8C85BHFN85y/aYOEBViMMcVVnvuskVQkvZXS9WNY\nP7FfillimExK1xLyDCmM/g7OcQ5c/N8cYU7RCMRhhvBRWbyHQX6aFDlTw4q3F7Yh\nOTTk5NeFmYw75ITpnjEqAPCoRymRDA/QjUNID/RofEzlBkgOhapIJwtBZ0Wit2as\nc39yJLgxDRJmoJOni5S+BfmzHQBZf+2LE7BKl05shSOihMUNV4oS5uXqFkLRWVdC\naabIJsAyfuOHfVycRe+GS0s2c5NwPufiEIob5G/9gc/9KCrYI/fBYdHv0l88iOXn\ne0t3o1FOYc6eFlup2shVydi8hZyeQ3CfgBFOoieey6MCNepK9qu8PrwYeTXlTF9H\nUlRR8ATIqJmEsCAlK0ClNmyzfnVG5yvfypfTxAsOAIrvk1BvkYRoovhc4K/agSVA\nO9ktgvksOcZJxnuP0aMDvH4AXi/ByVNw9zBMiOioHwO4+plSO1FJ2HbAWyywec5G\nhlnrM+h5hsPQkw408N05\n=BXmc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T07:46:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi