wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt/commit/65e5a4713551920fb2b0face0d8bc64cfecd0e6e","node_id":"C_kwDONRrZeNoAKDY1ZTVhNDcxMzU1MTkyMGZiMmIwZmFjZTBkOGJjNjRjZmVjZDBlNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt/commit/e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c","sha":"e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c"}],"sha":"65e5a4713551920fb2b0face0d8bc64cfecd0e6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/65e5a4713551920fb2b0face0d8bc64cfecd0e6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53191688?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:07:26Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:07:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Assessment: Fix action item author being taken from the request body (#2278)\n\n* Assessment: Take the action item author from the token\n\nCreating and updating an action item stored the author sent in the request\nbody, so any course lecturer or editor could save an item under another\nperson''s name. The author is now set from the authenticated user, like for\ncategory assessments and assessments, and is no longer part of the request\nbodies.\n\n* Assessment: Stop sending the action item author from the client\n\nThe server sets the author from the token, so the action item panel no longer\nreads the user''s name and the request types drop the field.\n\n* Assessment: Trim the action item author like the completion author\n\nReuse the completion''s author name helper, which trims the name and falls\nback to the university login and the email when the token has no name.","tree":{"sha":"54c187f0160ff38c59d18c9fb1cd4d44f52703bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/54c187f0160ff38c59d18c9fb1cd4d44f52703bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c","verification":{"payload":"tree 54c187f0160ff38c59d18c9fb1cd4d44f52703bd\nparent b275da16a72c92d2bae285e5ba6f5772715bd224\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791281246 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791281246 +0200\n\nAssessment: Fix action item author being taken from the request body (#2278)\n\n* Assessment: Take the action item author from the token\n\nCreating and updating an action item stored the author sent in the request\nbody, so any course lecturer or editor could save an item under another\nperson''s name. The author is now set from the authenticated user, like for\ncategory assessments and assessments, and is no longer part of the request\nbodies.\n\n* Assessment: Stop sending the action item author from the client\n\nThe server sets the author from the token, so the action item panel no longer\nreads the user''s name and the request types drop the field.\n\n* Assessment: Trim the action item author like the completion author\n\nReuse the completion''s author name helper, which trims the name and falls\nback to the university login and the email when the token has no name.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxMheCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfrEQAJejGzZs500GBHutONYSlAnc\nTDAORefZR5zGChwudavf+DC14MQYf4/sXYaXrokPucNAtnJPRIE8+5YBmJfGCBV5\nVXpobJR3Pw1TgUo+Nfj2PVCx/wFE3cstp5aFGEUmorQbSVKrId/+n7cZuVyMkQ+u\npEN7Bb8ZqU7ZYa4Ku/oIHvbSAYRuqMPniG+OvkSR5v2X8CFcrC/zE06ebwfSDKQY\nUEgQQvNqH0wftz7+7mG8Pn9r6ScKhuBGpnsaKYbXpVWoEaTp3wCf8+/YOe2/t54w\nFeyAWNJnlRwn6LshweH3nTaVoMOJ/YrctFgbwxQfjKC6WSPQ93JYOiNF/Al+i+zR\ni+wmcxpWApB+LiGIGizuyz2rpHLLYO4yyvquzjHLfQYeffDoatzySMxGJmymmqEH\nfav57W+O8AaqZXcTzD8mC9Ujt7FWfxvhSp6JyIzGvU7y+tGpdAGmolfe3akZ/XYc\nOSB51xKt5tzBU68Vh7q5Pcu3F/i0M6GapBz2Qe52LG0AvOUeRUdMZfo16cL35RXR\nN5y/cIwp4oKB/zRmslIrflX6GHWFOtjXQicNLiT7uRALHNSP3U1s5lwk5/IxELTX\nV9e2OomwslahpLaOtpEf3NNECfhGlju5YcNAXx+Z/SCsi/jdedCydIG8qh4K15aR\nO3zv2bIQB+YV1x1LLBwY\n=/KdC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T10:07:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt/commit/e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c","node_id":"C_kwDONRrZeNoAKGU5ZjRkNGQyNTBlYzVkZDQ3NTZmNTRhNTc5OWE0NzVmYmNhMjlhM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt/commit/b275da16a72c92d2bae285e5ba6f5772715bd224","sha":"b275da16a72c92d2bae285e5ba6f5772715bd224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/b275da16a72c92d2bae285e5ba6f5772715bd224"}],"sha":"e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/e9f4d4d250ec5dd4756f54a5799a475fbca29a3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53191688?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/b275da16a72c92d2bae285e5ba6f5772715bd224/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:07:10Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:07:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Assessment: Fix evaluation reminders overwriting course phase settings saved during the send (#2279)\n\n* Assessment: Add a table for the evaluation reminder state\n\nRecords per course phase and evaluation type when a reminder was last sent,\nso the assessment service owns that state instead of keeping it in core''s\ncourse phase restricted data.\n\n* Assessment: Store the last reminder send in the assessment database\n\nSending an evaluation reminder wrote the name, the whole restricted data and\nthe whole student readable data it had read before mailing back to core to\npersist lastSentAt. Settings saved while the mails were sent were overwritten\nwith that stale copy.\n\nThe send time is now upserted into the evaluation_reminder table and nothing\nis written to core. Phases that sent reminders before keep their previous\nsend time: it is read from the restricted data until the first new send.\nA new GET /config/reminders endpoint returns the send times for the settings\npage.\n\n* Assessment: Read the reminder send times from the assessment server\n\nThe reminder card loads the last send per evaluation type from the new\nreminders endpoint and refreshes it after a send. Send times that earlier\nversions stored in the course phase are still shown until a new reminder is\nsent. Saving the template no longer writes lastSentAtByType and keeps the\nother reminder fields as they are.\n\n* Assessment: Cover the reminder send times endpoint roles in e2e\n\n* Assessment: Save only the reminder template and wait for the send times\n\nSaving the reminder template sends only the mailing settings, like the results\nmail card, so other course phase settings are no longer written back from a\nstale copy. Reminders cannot be sent while the previous send times are loading\nor failed to load, so the \"already sent\" warning is never skipped.\n\n* Assessment: Keep the newest reminder send and test the failure paths\n\nA send that finishes later with an older timestamp no longer replaces a newer\none. Tests now cover that a failed write still returns the report, that a\nfailed read aborts before any mail is sent, and the checks that need no\ndatabase run as plain unit tests again. The seed also resets the demo phase''s\nreminder state.\n\n* Core: Remove the unused assessment reminder lastSentAt query\n\nThe assessment server keeps the reminder send times in its own database, so\ncore has no writer for mailingSettings.assessmentReminder.lastSentAtByType.","tree":{"sha":"af15fdee0bc99aa9081268656d3dc2030949ebd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/af15fdee0bc99aa9081268656d3dc2030949ebd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/b275da16a72c92d2bae285e5ba6f5772715bd224","verification":{"payload":"tree af15fdee0bc99aa9081268656d3dc2030949ebd7\nparent f4f06dd431ea82a174ae780c02451b365e7a120f\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791281230 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791281230 +0200\n\nAssessment: Fix evaluation reminders overwriting course phase settings saved during the send (#2279)\n\n* Assessment: Add a table for the evaluation reminder state\n\nRecords per course phase and evaluation type when a reminder was last sent,\nso the assessment service owns that state instead of keeping it in core''s\ncourse phase restricted data.\n\n* Assessment: Store the last reminder send in the assessment database\n\nSending an evaluation reminder wrote the name, the whole restricted data and\nthe whole student readable data it had read before mailing back to core to\npersist lastSentAt. Settings saved while the mails were sent were overwritten\nwith that stale copy.\n\nThe send time is now upserted into the evaluation_reminder table and nothing\nis written to core. Phases that sent reminders before keep their previous\nsend time: it is read from the restricted data until the first new send.\nA new GET /config/reminders endpoint returns the send times for the settings\npage.\n\n* Assessment: Read the reminder send times from the assessment server\n\nThe reminder card loads the last send per evaluation type from the new\nreminders endpoint and refreshes it after a send. Send times that earlier\nversions stored in the course phase are still shown until a new reminder is\nsent. Saving the template no longer writes lastSentAtByType and keeps the\nother reminder fields as they are.\n\n* Assessment: Cover the reminder send times endpoint roles in e2e\n\n* Assessment: Save only the reminder template and wait for the send times\n\nSaving the reminder template sends only the mailing settings, like the results\nmail card, so other course phase settings are no longer written back from a\nstale copy. Reminders cannot be sent while the previous send times are loading\nor failed to load, so the \"already sent\" warning is never skipped.\n\n* Assessment: Keep the newest reminder send and test the failure paths\n\nA send that finishes later with an older timestamp no longer replaces a newer\none. Tests now cover that a failed write still returns the report, that a\nfailed read aborts before any mail is sent, and the checks that need no\ndatabase run as plain unit tests again. The seed also resets the demo phase''s\nreminder state.\n\n* Core: Remove the unused assessment reminder lastSentAt query\n\nThe assessment server keeps the reminder send times in its own database, so\ncore has no writer for mailingSettings.assessmentReminder.lastSentAtByType.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxMhOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlcYQAEv7/rOF3LWszwbyXP8fca+l\nCfWS1iG0OU1sSJ/TDTcKgVH2tFIu+mzVwVBHjKuHea3udnQItQtSLKNHxGpmZPUx\nhIJNDtIpLSYyNqT3VMAGwTT66QFp0N63ZDE3owQE3IA4FQYmTRM23O+BMWrmwDhW\n9BpPjrdUyVPPcltP1PSn+xH7FCxmchW+7QCsO0cik/pHTAvdobDxrs7AZCNby8kg\nme/cc1Fg59M8bTknHk3VC1kfrHH8p20gGIjMFSnSOLvU0lSgIqOhkqQGx1nmN9rE\nyJOpa5yCKDcpdNXMcRt6yMTlvC5uKtezHEs53r3jong7CHsPmqwMZzmDERICpRm+\nYouq1pcRPua71IhAOPA7VC7ehvMsg6LGNpfjhHVO/Vytl1iKfE6rmcQ2ynqR7czS\npWLMhHqUBLX8r1PaAfvS5mIxzALkmXd2T/W9guZF05YO54w4yQgIZ32ZAHuvCrLK\njtKKqhSN4cuNTrN5pkRJOSoENgyx9YF0ohYdQBDXEOt89Lny8gy6pf9Wr4/urwUi\n6aCsnOSLI2Hg1JD/XH+wClRJqN6ZQqDBecnV2+AEZ3YPuZmMuICAmEgiQ7bWc2lx\npww8x8UTuP1JQu0XSaxKADw4wkiAZxtjxLvfCtw+LK3BXDkKLxHv5W0fF0NBUgtb\nSh9vrFu6zZpq6+vgjV2w\n=5lV9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T10:07:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":