{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53191688?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/04085528862f884d38905ead12b27fc73b3580d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:56:09Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:56:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Assessment: Send a mail to students when results are released (#2255)\n\n* Assessment: Add a table for the results-released mail recipients\n\nRecords which participants already got the results mail of a phase, so a\nlater release only notifies the ones who did not. The rows are part of the\nprivacy export and deletion.\n\n* Assessment: Mail students when assessment results are released\n\nReleasing results now sends the phase''s results mail through core''s manual\nmailing endpoint when the lecturer enabled it. Only participants who can see\nresults are mailed (final assessments, or everyone in evaluation-only phases),\nand each one only once: recipients are claimed before the send, and the claims\nof failed sends are released so a later release retries them.\n\nA mail failure does not undo the release; the response reports it instead.\n\n* Assessment: Add the results-released mail to the settings page\n\nLecturers write the mail with the shared template editor and placeholders,\nlike the other phases'' mailing settings, and switch on whether releasing the\nresults sends it. The switch stays disabled until course mailing is configured\nand the template has a subject and content.\n\nThe reminder card now reads the course phase through the same hook.\n\n* Assessment: Report the results mail when releasing results\n\nThe release dialog says when students will be notified, and a toast reports\nhow many mails went out, or that they could not be sent.\n\n* Documentation: Describe the assessment results mail\n\n* Assessment: Retry every results mail recipient core did not confirm\n\nClaims are now kept only for recipients core reports as mailed. A recipient\ncore skipped without listing it as failed, for example one without an email\naddress, is retried on the next release instead of being dropped.\n\n* Assessment: Clarify the results mail feedback\n\nThe release dialog only promises a mail when course mailing is configured,\nand the toast says when every student had already been notified. Re-seeding\nthe demo course also resets who received the results mail.","tree":{"sha":"6e6d7c59c3add7986ef86eb32ebc2a7e3919702c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/6e6d7c59c3add7986ef86eb32ebc2a7e3919702c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/04085528862f884d38905ead12b27fc73b3580d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e6d7c59c3add7986ef86eb32ebc2a7e3919702c\nparent 26e48d5d5e0b5a9d467384ad2b894ec5a8c8fd76\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791190569 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791190569 +0000\n\nAssessment: Send a mail to students when results are released (#2255)\n\n* Assessment: Add a table for the results-released mail recipients\n\nRecords which participants already got the results mail of a phase, so a\nlater release only notifies the ones who did not. The rows are part of the\nprivacy export and deletion.\n\n* Assessment: Mail students when assessment results are released\n\nReleasing results now sends the phase''s results mail through core''s manual\nmailing endpoint when the lecturer enabled it. Only participants who can see\nresults are mailed (final assessments, or everyone in evaluation-only phases),\nand each one only once: recipients are claimed before the send, and the claims\nof failed sends are released so a later release retries them.\n\nA mail failure does not undo the release; the response reports it instead.\n\n* Assessment: Add the results-released mail to the settings page\n\nLecturers write the mail with the shared template editor and placeholders,\nlike the other phases'' mailing settings, and switch on whether releasing the\nresults sends it. The switch stays disabled until course mailing is configured\nand the template has a subject and content.\n\nThe reminder card now reads the course phase through the same hook.\n\n* Assessment: Report the results mail when releasing results\n\nThe release dialog says when students will be notified, and a toast reports\nhow many mails went out, or that they could not be sent.\n\n* Documentation: Describe the assessment results mail\n\n* Assessment: Retry every results mail recipient core did not confirm\n\nClaims are now kept only for recipients core reports as mailed. A recipient\ncore skipped without listing it as failed, for example one without an email\naddress, is retried on the next release instead of being dropped.\n\n* Assessment: Clarify the results mail feedback\n\nThe release dialog only promises a mail when course mailing is configured,\nand the toast says when every student had already been notified. Re-seeding\nthe demo course also resets who received the results mail.","reason"