pi.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/09521669a65fb7ffff11c4563f00ee8a7e2bb16b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T14:50:21Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T14:50:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Team Allocation: Fix student name update ignoring the course phase in the URL (#2244)\n\n* Team Allocation: Write student names into the course phase from the URL\n\nThe handler never read the :coursePhaseID the auth middleware checked and updated allocations in the phase named by the body. The coursePhaseID field is removed from the request.\n\n* Team Allocation: Stop sending the course phase in the student name request\n\nThe phase only goes into the URL now.","tree":{"sha":"1816f60e2ba15baa76252616a18f9086baee1e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/1816f60e2ba15baa76252616a18f9086baee1e3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/09521669a65fb7ffff11c4563f00ee8a7e2bb16b","verification":{"payload":"tree 1816f60e2ba15baa76252616a18f9086baee1e3c\nparent ffb1b8ea88829aae5051218772c56a8ab903dd3f\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791125421 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791125421 +0200\n\nTeam Allocation: Fix student name update ignoring the course phase in the URL (#2244)\n\n* Team Allocation: Write student names into the course phase from the URL\n\nThe handler never read the :coursePhaseID the auth middleware checked and updated allocations in the phase named by the body. The coursePhaseID field is removed from the request.\n\n* Team Allocation: Stop sending the course phase in the student name request\n\nThe phase only goes into the URL now.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwmetCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6tUQACTDfzl