://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/4117e0d86dee4a22f25d9e66176b328aeb795dff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:00:04Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:00:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"General: Close the open Dependabot alerts for axios, brace-expansion, fast-uri, ip-address and undici (#2224)\n\n* Clients: Bump brace-expansion, fast-uri, ip-address and undici past their advisories\n\nRe-resolves the transitive dependencies within their parents'' existing\nranges to close the Dependabot alerts on clients/yarn.lock:\n\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 -> 1.1.21, 5.0.9 -> 5.0.12 (GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr)\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 -> 3.1.8 (GHSA-hrr3-gc8f-f4qj)\n- ip-address 10.5.0 -> 10.7.3 (GHSA-j6r3-76f7-8jcv, GHSA-rpw4-54j3-4h4q,\n  GHSA-2vr4-cq9g-pvrc)\n- undici 6.28.0 -> 6.29.0 (GHSA-r53p-7pc4-xj5r)\n\n* Clients: Resolve nx''s pinned axios to 1.20.0\n\nnx pins axios to exactly 1.18.1, up to and including the latest nx 23.2.1,\nso the nested copy cannot be bumped through its parent''s range. A scoped\nresolution moves it onto the 1.20.0 the workspace already uses and closes\nGHSA-j8rh-479h-cp32, GHSA-4hqw-qxg8-jxx2, GHSA-m8m8-qj5v-23w3,\nGHSA-44g4-m2mj-wpvx, GHSA-r4gj-5m52-g5wh, GHSA-vh66-26gq-q6x8,\nGHSA-9fr6-4gfg-395g, GHSA-x97p-jq2g-jp4f and GHSA-3pq3-5fj3-cg6v.\n\n* Documentation: Bump brace-expansion, fast-uri and ip-address past their advisories\n\nRe-resolves the transitive dependencies within their parents'' existing\nranges to close the Dependabot alerts on docs/yarn.lock:\n\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 -> 1.1.21, 5.0.9 -> 5.0.12 (GHSA-6j4f-fj2g-mc7p,\n  GHSA-qhr7-859c-m2p7, GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr)\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 -> 3.1.8 (GHSA-hrr3-gc8f-f4qj)\n- ip-address 10.5.0 -> 10.7.3 (GHSA-j6r3-76f7-8jcv, GHSA-h3mg-xc3c-68pw,\n  GHSA-rpw4-54j3-4h4q, GHSA-2vr4-cq9g-pvrc)","tree":{"sha":"2ffb3015dc9761198c7d8e9c38500648edc4cf68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/2ffb3015dc9761198c7d8e9c38500648edc4cf68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/4117e0d86dee4a22f25d9e66176b328aeb795dff","verification":{"payload":"tree 2ffb3015dc9761198c7d8e9c38500648edc4cf68\nparent bba9fb7ff4dd6226c97808f3c919c7168a2027b7\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1791050404 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791050404 +0200\n\nGeneral: Close the open Dependabot alerts for axios, brace-expansion, fast-uri, ip-address and undici (#2224)\n\n* Clients: Bump brace-expansion, fast-uri, ip-address and undici past their advisories\n\nRe-resolves the transitive dependencies within their parents'' existing\nranges to close the Dependabot alerts on clients/yarn.lock:\n\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 -> 1.1.21, 5.0.9 -> 5.0.12 (GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr)\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 -> 3.1.8 (GHSA-hrr3-gc8f-f4qj)\n- ip-address 10.5.0 -> 10.7.3 (GHSA-j6r3-76f7-8jcv, GHSA-rpw4-54j3-4h4q,\n  GHSA-2vr4-cq9g-pvrc)\n- undici 6.28.0 -> 6.29.0 (GHSA-r53p-7pc4-xj5r)\n\n* Clients: Resolve nx''s pinned axios to 1.20.0\n\nnx pins axios to exactly 1.18.1, up to and including the latest nx 23.2.1,\nso the nested copy cannot be bumped through its parent''s range. A scoped\nresolution moves it onto the 1.20.0 the workspace already uses and closes\nGHSA-j8rh-479h-cp32, GHSA-4hqw-qxg8-jxx2, GHSA-m8m8-qj5v-23w3,\nGHSA-44g4-m2mj-wpvx, GHSA-r4gj-5m52-g5wh, GHSA-vh66-26gq-q6x8,\nGHSA-9fr6-4gfg-395g, GHSA-x97p-jq2g-jp4f and GHSA-3pq3-5fj3-cg6v.\n\n* Documentation: Bump brace-expansion, fast-uri and ip-address past their advisories\n\nRe-resolves the transitive dependencies within their parents'' existing\nranges to close the Dependabot alerts on docs/yarn.lock:\n\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 -> 1.1.21, 5.0.9 -> 5.0.12 (GHSA-6j4f-fj2g-mc7p,\n  GHSA-qhr7-859c-m2p7, GHSA-q2hr-2g5m-vwhr)\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 -> 3.1.8 (GHSA-hrr3-gc8f-f4qj)\n- ip-address 10.5.0 -> 10.7.3 (GHSA-j6r3-76f7-8jcv, GHSA-h3mg-xc3c-68pw,\n  GHSA-rpw4-54j3-4h4q, GHSA-2vr4-cq9g-pvrc)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwUKkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARLMQAHlj/xs8Lub+Fe0JRQFOiFNw\nCM1ub/JgFyzGmV8yaTuqiPKgHj/S7Evi5Do3a/iADF+kfoKF8SjDLUfqXzFzJnn3\nw8OdWswMBlvTxgcXCFMQ61Xcitc5X7lFfnqRrgZNY/5aR409svH8IGNr4cR/PU8Q\neFVjc/LKl5lp1la1O7LH++5PjDGiCjp5O/tODs1/u2b58irHmfDfhbGV+NTcKmPd\nfOrnDmf3lVNPdc1kEDHY+wYOw5oQRDdlWShpt14Cwb88Cz9jm+ZEMcyQuU1sNcdD\nXvbfLw4tR+o1rxJqceJ+6a+nTLg7JL6dDWngqcdnB/6tt+W5Kmve02SVOWdP5m6w\nMzwKpeIfsn7n0pPOJo9kRwT0FIoRmhYrqgznrTsZgZupX/LT2jPbQHrP3tAezAlT\nLT6g6xvQtBbfTUsua7cTBP336UqyC09kRB+s3yymcqC2P6n1FmSwImgFqFLQGQ0c\nN+M/L7JVYZ0fCSdLz1FB549+hka67LsHqKi8o4nEcuStOi+Yz6Alu4yVbOu0RJ7t\nmCZOIYNOdPd/9FMSxg+rabANn+KB8Pvac+E520shVKuK/WopFDd0TuRhIzpKBcy5\nTkQviNX8PeKybnaaY45Y2dWGJ8CGwTFg3ZsOE/oTZ2BzjRCI1Pb7ddsk7Vu0w8xU\nBE2BbsALz7L53UuCenXk\n=9ymH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T18:00:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use