 schema export menu\n\nThe schema export button becomes a dropdown matching the assessment\nexport menu: PDF / Print prints the schema report, JSON keeps the\nexisting template download.\n\n* E2E: Cover the assessment schema PDF and JSON export\n\n* Documentation: Describe the assessment template export\n\n* Assessment: Keep line breaks in competency and score-level guidance of the schema report\n\n* E2E: Assert the schema editor is hidden when printing the schema report","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv95ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApMMQAAxM/7MrPBmBbLgde8gS1SmG\nFhz8tKFupAwU48YBk2+cJXRMUP+MelmM1xVuusYQ12m8tH0uZZoRopY2MtT5eMBS\nOEdbu3teePPBotsZSUaf/w8e9EUZUrXYBSzf5epX1/y4pGCdtagEcdtnp/GhGTAb\nQrzOGg6Gi7rVa1rGUcNy2FDVnxCyBaVKwWLYamoyzDoj7knIDg/hupKpLBJqtl8E\nypY76+2lfNI6VGwCe5Bcx/zk3E96jLvDbVa23vejnXDLhCzuldq8TjWK3868fa/4\nk2dXz/M4InmOibYMuFlHvw/LEDt1tShLuWPetk5W98ydCbVEazYZx61c7jaGqZrB\n99IT7dmty6P5x71yscsJhsZVIm+V9lcGBVBBQfWGhd4caTAM1+al831c4eKAyGdp\ntNMFolC9dmNi026mwbC7eMI8lOjYyKvfd3WXF1e1+VDcLZSzc0yvlRBAqNyRVLwE\nbeH2JPc9cTaIZtxQnL2zjqy26rKA5fNb/42PXEoeCYUCUNKfKPZcmZcYeibVzLVn\nj/EOSG6vgT0QwXWn1FADr4hz07vcR2sFIUfdiqwKt8LcoIBdHByMDr2zoUqO6U1I\nsjwqQ+ujCNiEAawn+y1e64ciqM6Eu1J0s8hj6qN7TveolHojzUdUa3GgP1e80lx2\nkFyxN5gBPS/32RJiMazJ\n=hcTQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T16:39:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/recei