:48Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T10:52:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Assessment: Allow marking several assessments as final from the participants table (#2207)\n\n* Assessment: Mark or unmark several assessments as final in one request\n\nAdd POST .../completed/mark-complete/batch and\nPUT .../completed/unmark/batch. Each call runs in one transaction,\nmarks every eligible assessment and reports the rest as skipped with\na reason (no_completion, remaining_assessments, already_completed,\nnot_completed). The author is taken from the token. A phase that has\nnot started (mark) or is past its deadline (unmark) rejects the whole\nbatch with 403.\n\n* Assessment: Add client calls for marking several assessments as final\n\nAdd completions.markCompleteBatch and completions.unmarkBatch with\ntheir response types, cover both in the route table test, and add\nmutation hooks for the participants page that refresh the completion\ncaches on success.\n\n* Assessment: Mark or unmark assessments as final from the participants table\n\nAdd ''Mark as final'' and ''Unmark final'' to the participants table, for\none student from the row menu or for every selected student. Each\naction asks for confirmation, is disabled when it applies to none of\nthe selected students (unmarking also after the deadline), and\nreports how many assessments changed and why the others were skipped.\n\n* Assessment: Cap a batch completion request at 1000 course participations\n\n* Assessment: Fall back to the login or email as the batch completion author\n\n* Assessment: Record the changed course participations on batch completion audit entries\n\n* Assessment: Read the batch completion error through isAxiosError","tree":{"sha":"3fdbdb9cfeaf04a8ceea6ccda301529621ded267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/3fdbdb9cfeaf04a8ceea6ccda301529621ded267"},"u