,"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt/commit/c4834f1644d660f77131a0be965fac8ad70ec579","node_id":"C_kwDONRrZeNoAKGM0ODM0ZjE2NDRkNjYwZjc3MTMxYTBiZTk2NWZhYzhhZDcwZWM1Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt/commit/1ff7733669dd09d3c3b23d5436e655f96f636ec3","sha":"1ff7733669dd09d3c3b23d5436e655f96f636ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/1ff7733669dd09d3c3b23d5436e655f96f636ec3"}],"sha":"c4834f1644d660f77131a0be965fac8ad70ec579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/c4834f1644d660f77131a0be965fac8ad70ec579"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53191688?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rappm","id":53191688,"login":"rappm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTkxNjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/1ff7733669dd09d3c3b23d5436e655f96f636ec3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:52:37Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T11:52:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Deployment: Report the deployed version on every phase server (#2200)\n\n* Deployment: Report the deployed image tag as the server version\n\nThe phase servers already expose `Version` on their public `/info` endpoint,\nread from `SERVER_IMAGE_TAG`, and the admin System Status page renders it. No\ndeployment ever set that variable, so every card showed \"n/a\".\n\nForward each service''s deployed image tag (the release tag on a prod deploy,\nthe branch or PR tag on dev) into its container, and add the missing\ninfrastructure-setup tag defaults so the compose file resolves fully.\n\n* Deployment: Report a version from the local development stacks\n\nThe dev and minimal stacks build the servers from source, so there is no image\ntag to forward. Report the same `local` marker the client images already use,\nso the System Status page shows a version outside production as well.\n\n* Testing: Cover the version each phase server reports on /info\n\nPass the version marker to the phase servers in the e2e stack and assert that\nevery one of them reports it, so the wiring that feeds the System Status page\ncannot silently regress to \"n/a\".","tree":{"sha":"47a9588853f3df8fc82490b77996978336b45e81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/47a9588853f3df8fc82490b77996978336b45e81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/1ff7733669dd09d3c3b23d5436e655f96f636ec3","verification":{"payload":"tree 47a9588853f3df8fc82490b77996978336b45e81\nparent 3a524ed4f0825fdf3f84c3e8057086677f6a4c80\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1790250757 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790250757 +0200\n\nDeployment: Report the deployed version on every phase server (#2200)\n\n* Deployment: Report the deployed image tag as the server version\n\nThe phase servers already expose `Version` on their public `/info` endpoint,\nread from `SERVER_IMAGE_TAG`, and the admin System Status page renders it. No\ndeployment ever set that variable, so every card showed \"n/a\".\n\nForward each service''s deployed image tag (the release tag on a prod deploy,\nthe branch or PR tag on dev) into its container, and add the missing\ninfrastructure-setup tag defaults so the compose file resolves fully.\n\n* Deployment: Report a version from the local development stacks\n\nThe dev and minimal stacks build the servers from source, so there is no image\ntag to forward. Report the same `local` marker the client images already use,\nso the System Status page shows a version outside production as well.\n\n* Testing: Cover the version each phase server reports on /info\n\nPass the version marker to the phase servers in the e2e stack and assert that\nevery one of them reports it, so the wiring that feeds the System Status page\ncannot silently regress to \"n/a\".","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtQ8FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN5wQAGydeZty5z4aF8mWI265mE4M\nyQbaURo6bW93qOMpuxfUoSAO4l7jxvvumtAyONNJwFH9DGi3A4uNSkgffu1QsD9s\nRqtiuI+6b4d7LKhWV2cimqQMSjVJ5zP1a5KaPUvdXdCG8RPLsD33QpV/Sw0n78md\nkoLjt+4ajepoM3nzB43vp4jwRyKCfdATjLYEx4ne2KiFT4Lo1j9A31VpM842oKaL\n3R73J1S3qOshLRuLttskmhdaX5qGkRZxb+j/Z8byH+VGt73c7B/b5GP5aQCP6E1b\nMuzNXevmUUMoTF+S2ic0SBZx2xfytbHwJrSA3+9n6IdS0k9zTyqfL6xAqgxggoWO\nj1gXrN+TK/AW5xYBbAzhzvQmYd3HMr+6ACMG0xGTkoKbza5a46wsf/iGCywW3O2i\ncsRvHt9/Ga+kLHQPa5NcM7P21Gjm/1h1eGhk5d5XC7Rj2gIyg0aSsF8b3kPKpS6T\nUUxyIpFbcxHky1cAKd6gKa+J5hhsTQ+hHK6zWQtausF9WXb3FtSITdlHCR+hY2Bi\nPI4CI1gNAMq+iap3kaBJLNB7DhyhQAH3jWnSILFkoxO56eHMP6RootftVp45t21G\nGRY8y/69fIndPY7NdnC7ra4uq6nh5lG9ZOx4vDeSSB9hdQr7n/xCmmiF2MJv1dft\nQuiAOtZqYwUIhwC2geFh\n=BwO4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T11:52:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht