os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/fc370c770d1a402083a618d5a45cef39a0ef9257/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:28:58Z","email":"29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"renovate[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:28:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Dependencies: Update all non-major dependencies (#2156)\n\n* Dependencies: Update all non-major dependencies\n\n* Dependencies: Pull the transitive axios and Sentry copies up to the bump\n\nThe axios bump to ^1.20.0 left @tumaet/prompt-shared-state resolving its\nown ^1.19.0 range to a nested 1.19.0 copy, so the core client saw two\ndistinct axios type identities and every AxiosInstance handoff in\ncore/src/network/client.ts stopped type checking. Dedupe collapses both\nranges onto 1.20.0.\n\nsentry-go v0.49.0 dropped ClientOptions.DisableLogs, which the still\npinned sentry-go/logrus v0.48.0 reads, so every server module failed to\nbuild through that indirect dependency. Bump it in lockstep.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Maximilian Rapp <maximilian.rapp@tum.de>","tree":{"sha":"76947963539a3fa08ac29ff12cf943010a24ca4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/76947963539a3fa08ac29ff12cf943010a24ca4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/fc370c770d1a402083a618d5a45cef39a0ef9257","verification":{"payload":"tree 76947963539a3fa08ac29ff12cf943010a24ca4e\nparent b8c3ce6f9c07b1d27375238f8a4bb214f422e779\nauthor renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1788449338 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788449338 +0000\n\nDependencies: Update all non-major dependencies (#2156)\n\n* Dependencies: Update all non-major dependencies\n\n* Dependencies: Pull the transitive axios and Sentry copies up to the bump\n\nThe axios bump to ^1.20.0 left @tumaet/prompt-shared-state resolving its\nown ^1.19.0 range to a nested 1.19.0 copy, so the core client saw two\ndistinct axios type identities and every AxiosInstance handoff in\ncore/src/network/client.ts stopped type checking. Dedupe collapses both\nranges onto 1.20.0.\n\nsentry-go v0.49.0 dropped ClientOptions.DisableLogs, which the still\npinned sentry-go/logrus v0.48.0 reads, so every server module failed to\nbuild through that indirect dependency. Bump it in lockstep.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Maximilian Rapp <maximilian.rapp@tum.de>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmZI6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtTcQAGBaZ0/dPpnUzIF+ERCGjyun\n4kuz07WhQocn4BBQdf7Cy8eWJo31Rfo2S28V631zQqBeXJYGr9EHFM5kKE19Kejn\n20KY+qoITYQN2y8ChbVl8iu+9P5kYJQ1WuGOalA9mjWLWthgc9iQkX9+DZku42li\nipFXd0vnHTTyR15jpy0F0d2e5IZf7sUH+8VZKabWLEhIbjQ91TC2kA9yHj0xR6KX\neANLARXlDFgH9YCgXWwiwST4j0nuakMklXSes1cPmMtebZkkNjzi+JgIoS8I0Nyp\n+oHmSv2SPVYicEzgA1J5gaUm21eLHAdcdsPl6CzCHawGkWCzvr+IP4IenspsRqsT\nU9zOjTx0RutcUkbWMyJFBd09/C53ZRgBcCmkrBn7NNQBVorWHLsEB5paX9KCOORv\n7fXzgWbCPHJYN8baBOBlO1R+121UszW4TPlEfs1aDGeAC/aLZQdYKQUVgTjgaDiM\nTa6roo+3m0dF5rqzeKhf2IWscDwJcDeCL4AXmjEz1QzzDConzwrkZs2RvFWvFY3O\nBLS4n+3iQVj+xmigI77jJ4MhL5syGnJ3ReALz7LFoZrPuZboSxwcamiAZ4RZqEuz\nO3tS+ijtzvVMJgegDg0T+FJQHJeflqiwD2sejXpvVyXCyd11boQEx4wUy4ioFkpP\ngIJRX4il4mqIH9gQTWyL\n=drzu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T15:28:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g