ed_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rappm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/commits/18e41f971e13bcd6c917e2470ae9c4b8d277ae59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:36:36Z","email":"53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Maximilian Rapp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:36:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Core: Fix the undefined service call in the application form tests (#2148)\n\nThe two welcome text tests called GetApplicationFormWithDetails as a package\nfunction, but it is a method on ApplicationService, so the package failed to\ntypecheck and golangci-lint broke the pipeline on main. Call it on the suite''s\nservice like the neighbouring tests do.","tree":{"sha":"11876d80bbf67c60e29b070a295172c727998c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/trees/11876d80bbf67c60e29b070a295172c727998c71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prompt-edu/prompt/git/commits/18e41f971e13bcd6c917e2470ae9c4b8d277ae59","verification":{"payload":"tree 11876d80bbf67c60e29b070a295172c727998c71\nparent 61f08660d9bb35d07d560a790d3480e63ea08843\nauthor Maximilian Rapp <53191688+rappm@users.noreply.github.com> 1788258996 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788258996 +0200\n\nCore: Fix the undefined service call in the application form tests (#2148)\n\nThe two welcome text tests called GetApplicationFormWithDetails as a package\nfunction, but it is a method on ApplicationService, so the package failed to\ntypecheck and golangci-lint broke the pipeline on main. Call it on the suite''s\nservice like the neighbouring tests do.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABC