ch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ajwtech","id":6678192,"login":"ajwtech","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzgxOTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajwtech/MarketForge/commits/9437e825eec75bb7309822880e0aa0021f3267b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-10T19:18:33Z","email":"ajwtech@gmail.com","name":"Adam Wheeler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-10T19:18:33Z","email":"ajwtech@gmail.com","name":"Adam Wheeler"},"message":"feat: Implement comprehensive background system with toast notifications\n\nMajor Features:\n- ✨ Add dynamic background system with Strapi integration\n- 🎨 Implement 6 background presets (dark-elegant, purple-theme, sunset, ocean, cosmic, aurora)\n- 🌗 Full light/dark mode support for all background types\n- 📱 Support for color, gradient, image, pattern, and preset backgrounds\n- 🔧 Strapi component schema for background settings management\n\nToast Notification System:\n- 🍞 Add robust toast context with React context pattern\n- ✨ Implement glassy, translucent toast design with backdrop blur\n- 🎭 Framer Motion animations for smooth toast transitions\n- 🔄 Auto-deduplication to prevent duplicate notifications\n- ♿ Accessibility features with proper ARIA labels\n- 🎨 Theme-aware styling for all toast types (success, error, warning, info)\n\nUI/UX Improvements:\n- 🎯 Enhanced page routing with proper fallback handling\n- 🔍 Missing page detection with user-friendly notifications\n- 🎨 Improved glass effect with refined opacity and blur effects\n- 🎨 Removed harsh border effects for cleaner modern look\n- 📐 Added beveled corners (rounded-2xl) for premium appearance\n\nTechnical Infrastructure:\n- 🔧 Fixed Tailwind CSS content paths for proper class generation\n- 🔄 Background conversion utilities for Strapi-to-Next.js integration\n- 📋 TypeScript interfaces for type safety across the stack\n- 🎛️ Demo page for testing all background configurations\n- 🛠️ Health check script for system validation\n\nIntegration & Architecture:\n- 🔗 Seamless Strapi CMS integration for content editors\n- 🏗️ Component-based architecture for reusability\n- 🎯 Context providers for global state management\n- 📚 Comprehensive validation and error handling\n- 🎨 Theme-aware components throughout the application\n\nFiles Changed: 36 files across Next.js frontend, Strapi backend, and supporting utilities\n\nBreaking Changes: None - all changes are additive and backward compatible","tree":{"sha":"961dc8b865a151ba139894081c51b42212411198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajwtech/MarketForge/git/trees/961dc8b865a151ba139894081c51b42212411198"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ajwtech/MarketForge/git/commits/9437e825eec75bb7309822880e0aa0021f3267b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6678192?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ajwtech","id":6678192,"login":"ajwtech","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzgxOTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajwtech/orgs","received_events_url":"ht